(2294253, 316587, 21714, '<td valign="top">Not for bottled tap water though :)</td>', 'Not for bottled tap water though :)', '2006-04-07 05:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294255, 316364, 52521, '<td valign="top">Burning down the house are we :) ... no just kidding, good idea, too much burnin'' for my taste though :D</td>', 'Burning down the house are we :) ... no just kidding, good idea, too much burnin'' for my taste though :D', '2006-04-07 05:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294268, 316521, 42181, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture, looks more like a tree.</td>', 'Amazing picture, looks more like a tree.', '2006-04-07 06:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294274, 317497, 42181, '<td valign="top">Great picture, you can almost feel the softness.</td>', 'Great picture, you can almost feel the softness.', '2006-04-07 06:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294295, 317412, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Good subject. The lighting seems a bit harsh. Perhaps a different time of day for the shot could be a stronger show of texture. Also, I think this is a case where the centered composition just doesn''t seem to be very stimulating.</td>', 'Cool idea. Good subject. The lighting seems a bit harsh. Perhaps a different time of day for the shot could be a stronger show of texture. Also, I think this is a case where the centered composition just doesn''t seem to be very stimulating.', '2006-04-07 06:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294297, 317797, 27164, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I expect a top ten with this lovely study.  DOF is great.  I just don''t like the border at all.</td>', 'Beautiful, I expect a top ten with this lovely study.  DOF is great.  I just don''t like the border at all.', '2006-04-07 06:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294303, 314737, 27164, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures, color, and composition.  The pink really stands out against the otherwise dull and monotonic color.  Nice bokeh as well.  One of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful textures, color, and composition.  The pink really stands out against the otherwise dull and monotonic color.  Nice bokeh as well.  One of my favorites of the challenge.', '2006-04-07 06:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294305, 317497, 27164, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color and shallow DOF.  I predict a high placement for this masterpiece.</td>', 'Nice use of color and shallow DOF.  I predict a high placement for this masterpiece.', '2006-04-07 06:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294310, 317699, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very creative and original idea. Nice lighting. Great detail. Really like the title too :-)</td>', 'Very creative and original idea. Nice lighting. Great detail. Really like the title too :-)', '2006-04-07 06:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294311, 314892, 51125, '<td valign="top">Warm and fine textures.</td>', 'Warm and fine textures.', '2006-04-07 06:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294312, 316685, 19831, '<td valign="top">Really nice job. Great lighting. Stimulating composition. Good example of a texture shot. Well done :-)</td>', 'Really nice job. Great lighting. Stimulating composition. Good example of a texture shot. Well done :-)', '2006-04-07 06:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294318, 316956, 19831, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, interesting shot here. I don''t feel like it is a great choice for texture, I''m not really ''feeling'' it, if you know what I mean. However, I will say this: Normally, photos of sculptures, statues and that sort don''t really do much for me. Here though, I think this is probably the first shot of that sort that I actually like. Outside of this challenge, I think this is a really nice image. A very stimulating point of view. Nice job and very fitting processing. Great sky. Strong composition with the nice vertical and all. Really cool shot, just doesn''t show texture that strongly to me.</td>', 'Hmmm, interesting shot here. I don''t feel like it is a great choice for texture, I''m not really ''feeling'' it, if you know what I mean. However, I will say this: Normally, photos of sculptures, statues and that sort don''t really do much for me. Here though, I think this is probably the first shot of that sort that I actually like. Outside of this challenge, I think this is a really nice image. A very stimulating point of view. Nice job and very fitting processing. Great sky. Strong composition with the nice vertical and all. Really cool shot, just doesn''t show texture that strongly to me.', '2006-04-07 06:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294322, 317824, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. Very creative approach to this challenge. I really like your processing of this image. Overall, it works. Good job.</td>', 'Nice concept. Very creative approach to this challenge. I really like your processing of this image. Overall, it works. Good job.', '2006-04-07 06:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294331, 317803, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice shot here! Stong composition. Good use of dof. Great lighting. Interesting subject. Good example of a texture shot. Nice job :-)</td>', 'Nice shot here! Stong composition. Good use of dof. Great lighting. Interesting subject. Good example of a texture shot. Nice job :-)', '2006-04-07 06:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294336, 315103, 36692, '<td valign="top">very cute pony :)</td>', 'very cute pony :)', '2006-04-07 06:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294340, 314977, 19831, '<td valign="top">Niice! Refreshingly unique approach to the challenge. Great idea. Very strong composition with the nice vertical and all. Fantastic lighting! And a really cool pic to boot! Makes me say "ewww" ...which is good in this case .<br/>:-)</td>', 'Niice! Refreshingly unique approach to the challenge. Great idea. Very strong composition with the nice vertical and all. Fantastic lighting! And a really cool pic to boot! Makes me say "ewww" ...which is good in this case .:-)', '2006-04-07 06:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294352, 316307, 22781, '<td valign="top">WOW! 10!</td>', 'WOW! 10!', '2006-04-07 07:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294357, 317361, 23251, '<td valign="top">lol Yeah great idea!</td>', 'lol Yeah great idea!', '2006-04-07 07:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294373, 315103, 48298, '<td valign="top">I love horse photos!   Very soft and touchable...I like the crinkly mane.  10.</td>', 'I love horse photos!   Very soft and touchable...I like the crinkly mane.  10.', '2006-04-07 07:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294375, 315816, 48298, '<td valign="top">Ugh...I hate golf in general, but this definitely has a touchable texture.  Well done.</td>', 'Ugh...I hate golf in general, but this definitely has a touchable texture.  Well done.', '2006-04-07 07:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294376, 317361, 36692, '<td valign="top">Crazy cat! great photo :)</td>', 'Crazy cat! great photo :)', '2006-04-07 07:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294380, 316394, 36692, '<td valign="top">love the colour!</td>', 'love the colour!', '2006-04-07 07:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294382, 317190, 30018, '<td valign="top">Sweet.   I wish I could vote, this would easily be a &lt;10&gt;, and is probably a winner anyway.  WOW!</td>', 'Sweet.   I wish I could vote, this would easily be a <10>, and is probably a winner anyway.  WOW!', '2006-04-07 07:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294383, 317803, 48298, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Awesome color and sharp detail.  I can "feel" it, without wanting to feel it!  :)  10!</td>', 'Ouch!  Awesome color and sharp detail.  I can "feel" it, without wanting to feel it!  :)  10!', '2006-04-07 07:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294384, 316737, 48298, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and I can see all the texture on the little seeds.  Wonderful macro.</td>', 'Very nice color and I can see all the texture on the little seeds.  Wonderful macro.', '2006-04-07 07:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294387, 315588, 48298, '<td valign="top">Holy smokes...now THAT''S a macro!!!  WOW.  I''m impressed.  This should ribbon.  Beautiful color, too.  10 plus.  :)</td>', 'Holy smokes...now THAT''S a macro!!!  WOW.  I''m impressed.  This should ribbon.  Beautiful color, too.  10 plus.  :)', '2006-04-07 07:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294388, 315855, 48298, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely lovely.  So serene, with such soft mossy texture.  10.</td>', 'This is absolutely lovely.  So serene, with such soft mossy texture.  10.', '2006-04-07 07:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294390, 317773, 48298, '<td valign="top">Really pretty.  I love the textures on both the cat paw and the blanket.</td>', 'Really pretty.  I love the textures on both the cat paw and the blanket.', '2006-04-07 07:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294391, 317396, 48298, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  I can feel the tortoise scaliness and the fuzz on the plant, too.  10.</td>', 'Nice job!  I can feel the tortoise scaliness and the fuzz on the plant, too.  10.', '2006-04-07 07:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294392, 317677, 42984, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is your enemy here.  If your camera doesn''t have the ability to give you really small apertures (f16-F32) then try getting more square onto your subject so that the distances are much smaller.</td>', 'The depth of field is your enemy here.  If your camera doesn''t have the ability to give you really small apertures (f16-F32) then try getting more square onto your subject so that the distances are much smaller.', '2006-04-07 07:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294393, 317487, 42984, '<td valign="top">Fine shot, the backlight is everything to this</td>', 'Fine shot, the backlight is everything to this', '2006-04-07 07:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294395, 315953, 42984, '<td valign="top">I feel that the Thing is the major point of interest and not the texture. The Thing is such a strong image on its own. To really hit the mark on "texture" I guess you have to get up close and personal but of course you might lose something else.  Its a fine balance, hope the scoring proves me wrong</td>', 'I feel that the Thing is the major point of interest and not the texture. The Thing is such a strong image on its own. To really hit the mark on "texture" I guess you have to get up close and personal but of course you might lose something else.  Its a fine balance, hope the scoring proves me wrong', '2006-04-07 07:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294397, 317520, 42984, '<td valign="top">I hav a feeling the textures don''t dominate the image enough to give it impact. Pity because the idea is a really good one</td>', 'I hav a feeling the textures don''t dominate the image enough to give it impact. Pity because the idea is a really good one', '2006-04-07 07:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294398, 316685, 48298, '<td valign="top">Nice hot color and contrasting texture.</td>', 'Nice hot color and contrasting texture.', '2006-04-07 07:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294399, 317779, 42984, '<td valign="top">great piece of texture. I have the feeling there''s too much else in the frame and a more macro view may have got you an even higher score</td>', 'great piece of texture. I have the feeling there''s too much else in the frame and a more macro view may have got you an even higher score', '2006-04-07 07:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294400, 317771, 48298, '<td valign="top">Beautiful full frame, simple color, and sharp edges on the coral.</td>', 'Beautiful full frame, simple color, and sharp edges on the coral.', '2006-04-07 07:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294404, 316005, 48298, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and textures.  Might be over-sharpened.</td>', 'I really like the colors and textures.  Might be over-sharpened.', '2006-04-07 07:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294412, 314737, 48298, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and tones.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and tones.', '2006-04-07 07:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294419, 314743, 48298, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement.  I think I would have liked to have seen the earth tones in this, rather than see it in B&amp;W.  Good contrasting textures, though.</td>', 'Nice arrangement.  I think I would have liked to have seen the earth tones in this, rather than see it in B&W.  Good contrasting textures, though.', '2006-04-07 07:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294421, 317258, 48298, '<td valign="top">Pretty lighting.  Nice and soft.</td>', 'Pretty lighting.  Nice and soft.', '2006-04-07 07:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294425, 317805, 38032, '<td valign="top">My previous texture image was of my cat.  I thought it was a great example of texture - as this one is.  I like that I can see the many surfaces in one shot.  I hope this does better than mine did because people tend to vote down cat images especially if they seem "personal".  6</td>', 'My previous texture image was of my cat.  I thought it was a great example of texture - as this one is.  I like that I can see the many surfaces in one shot.  I hope this does better than mine did because people tend to vote down cat images especially if they seem "personal".  6', '2006-04-07 08:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294429, 317497, 38032, '<td valign="top">Wow ... i''ve seen many images of this sort of thing but this brings it to a new level.  I think the color and composition as well as the negative space combine for an effective, perfect textur image.</td>', 'Wow ... i''ve seen many images of this sort of thing but this brings it to a new level.  I think the color and composition as well as the negative space combine for an effective, perfect textur image.', '2006-04-07 08:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294431, 315383, 38032, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - even though I realize this is somewhere between death and dinner.</td>', 'Beautiful - even though I realize this is somewhere between death and dinner.', '2006-04-07 08:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294433, 317603, 38032, '<td valign="top">That''s beautiful and has great texture.</td>', 'That''s beautiful and has great texture.', '2006-04-07 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294435, 315855, 38032, '<td valign="top">Another extra soft effect on this one that i start to expect to see in the winner''s circle ... Very nice and the monochromatic element is striking.</td>', 'Another extra soft effect on this one that i start to expect to see in the winner''s circle ... Very nice and the monochromatic element is striking.', '2006-04-07 08:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294436, 315681, 38032, '<td valign="top">no trespasssing</td>', 'no trespasssing', '2006-04-07 08:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294437, 317546, 38032, '<td valign="top">interesting macro ... I get the feeling hair and stuff unfortunately won''t sit well with some people.  I like the intrgue here ... wonder what / where?!</td>', 'interesting macro ... I get the feeling hair and stuff unfortunately won''t sit well with some people.  I like the intrgue here ... wonder what / where?!', '2006-04-07 08:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294438, 315750, 38032, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of light and model.</td>', 'Awesome use of light and model.', '2006-04-07 08:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294440, 316857, 38032, '<td valign="top">abstract yet comprehendable ... I like the relief here. 7</td>', 'abstract yet comprehendable ... I like the relief here. 7', '2006-04-07 08:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294442, 317015, 38032, '<td valign="top">Yes! ....that''s my kinda image ... not to mention garlic is naturally a fave - as well as this image! Great reality and balance here.</td>', 'Yes! ....that''s my kinda image ... not to mention garlic is naturally a fave - as well as this image! Great reality and balance here.', '2006-04-07 08:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294445, 314796, 38032, '<td valign="top">Wow ... that''s extremely similar to my image! ... It''ll be interesting to see where the scores land.   Good luck.</td>', 'Wow ... that''s extremely similar to my image! ... It''ll be interesting to see where the scores land.   Good luck.', '2006-04-07 08:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294500, 317191, 16241, '<td valign="top">great!</td>', 'great!', '2006-04-07 09:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294502, 315152, 16241, '<td valign="top">great!</td>', 'great!', '2006-04-07 09:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294506, 317531, 11518, '<td valign="top">That has the Kapluggin signature all over it! 10 :)</td>', 'That has the Kapluggin signature all over it! 10 :)', '2006-04-07 09:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294516, 317662, 32033, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo, it almost looks real.  If I were to shoot this photo I would have attempted to bring out a little more detail in the shadows using a fill light.</td>', 'This is a very nice photo, it almost looks real.  If I were to shoot this photo I would have attempted to bring out a little more detail in the shadows using a fill light.', '2006-04-07 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294524, 317820, 32033, '<td valign="top">is in need of painting</td>', 'is in need of painting', '2006-04-07 09:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294529, 317679, 32033, '<td valign="top">shadows look great</td>', 'shadows look great', '2006-04-07 09:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294533, 317535, 16241, '<td valign="top">awesome textures here.  nicely processed, top shot!</td>', 'awesome textures here.  nicely processed, top shot!', '2006-04-07 09:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294540, 317539, 3735, '<td valign="top">Is this a D6 ?<br/>My husband opperates a D8 &amp; he loves this shot. <br/>please contact me and let me know.  10</td>', 'Is this a D6 ?My husband opperates a D8 & he loves this shot. please contact me and let me know.  10', '2006-04-07 09:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294542, 316341, 24715, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! No other comments needed.</td>', 'Beautiful! No other comments needed.', '2006-04-07 09:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294547, 317495, 16241, '<td valign="top">aish that looks cold!  great pic, congrats.</td>', 'aish that looks cold!  great pic, congrats.', '2006-04-07 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294548, 317191, 31443, '<td valign="top">Surreal and colorful, like it a lot..</td>', 'Surreal and colorful, like it a lot..', '2006-04-07 09:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294551, 314287, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and texture.</td>', 'Nice colors and texture.', '2006-04-07 09:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294552, 317348, 38248, '<td valign="top">I think this one should do really well.  8</td>', 'I think this one should do really well.  8', '2006-04-07 09:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294554, 317695, 24715, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. Do they sound good? :-)</td>', 'Cool photo. Do they sound good? :-)', '2006-04-07 09:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294555, 315373, 38248, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Absolutely gorgeous.  If this one doesn''t ribbon, I hope it''ll be offered as a print.  I love it. 9</td>', 'Wow.  Absolutely gorgeous.  If this one doesn''t ribbon, I hope it''ll be offered as a print.  I love it. 9', '2006-04-07 09:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294559, 314289, 31443, '<td valign="top">Year 9 was a good year...nice texture</td>', 'Year 9 was a good year...nice texture', '2006-04-07 09:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294567, 315088, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think you should have cropped out the rail or veranda bit at the bottom. Very nice though.</td>', 'I think you should have cropped out the rail or veranda bit at the bottom. Very nice though.', '2006-04-07 09:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294575, 316678, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the photo as an architectural photo but I''m not really getting a sense of texture from it.</td>', 'I like the photo as an architectural photo but I''m not really getting a sense of texture from it.', '2006-04-07 09:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294595, 317662, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  This is clever.  I wish the crackly stuff went all the way to the neck and shoulder, but the light and angle of the shot is great.  Her expression is priceless. I like your imaginative take on it!! 8</td>', 'ROFL  This is clever.  I wish the crackly stuff went all the way to the neck and shoulder, but the light and angle of the shot is great.  Her expression is priceless. I like your imaginative take on it!! 8', '2006-04-07 09:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294597, 315697, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I''d do some saturation work on the red tones, even if he didn''t look any more red than the image shows. Great detail on the feathers. I like the DOF with the blurred fence behind him - it gives a bit of a story that way.  Chickens crack me up.</td>', 'I think I''d do some saturation work on the red tones, even if he didn''t look any more red than the image shows. Great detail on the feathers. I like the DOF with the blurred fence behind him - it gives a bit of a story that way.  Chickens crack me up.', '2006-04-07 09:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294598, 317621, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the approach you took.  I''d like to see some more negative space in the foreground though. It almost seems chopped off.  The clarity and light is nice and I think the brown filter works well to showcase the nest and eggs. 7</td>', 'I like the approach you took.  I''d like to see some more negative space in the foreground though. It almost seems chopped off.  The clarity and light is nice and I think the brown filter works well to showcase the nest and eggs. 7', '2006-04-07 09:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294601, 314787, 7322, '<td valign="top">With this sort of image I like to see everything in focus. The part that is in focus looks great.</td>', 'With this sort of image I like to see everything in focus. The part that is in focus looks great.', '2006-04-07 09:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294602, 315833, 15711, '<td valign="top">The off center subject and the subtle light is fery appealing. Reminds me of the fun summers I spent at the beach with my family.  Thanks for the nice memory. 8</td>', 'The off center subject and the subtle light is fery appealing. Reminds me of the fun summers I spent at the beach with my family.  Thanks for the nice memory. 8', '2006-04-07 09:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294606, 317495, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is stunning. I love the single figure. Usually you see him walking away and I like that he is coming toward you.  Great perspective.  One of my favs.</td>', 'This is stunning. I love the single figure. Usually you see him walking away and I like that he is coming toward you.  Great perspective.  One of my favs.', '2006-04-07 09:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294607, 315833, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very nice combination of textures - but the shell is missing a part, I feel.  Perhaps it is broken.</td>', 'Very nice combination of textures - but the shell is missing a part, I feel.  Perhaps it is broken.', '2006-04-07 10:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294608, 315148, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is so artfully presented. I don''t know why, but I really like it. Nice DOF too. 8</td>', 'This is so artfully presented. I don''t know why, but I really like it. Nice DOF too. 8', '2006-04-07 10:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294612, 317531, 15711, '<td valign="top">Water doesn''t speak texture to me but this is an absolutely GORGEOUS shot.  She is beautiful. The light, the 3/4 profile and her hair - stunning.</td>', 'Water doesn''t speak texture to me but this is an absolutely GORGEOUS shot.  She is beautiful. The light, the 3/4 profile and her hair - stunning.', '2006-04-07 10:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294614, 315718, 15711, '<td valign="top">San Antonio??? I don''t really see texture but I like the leading line of it.</td>', 'San Antonio??? I don''t really see texture but I like the leading line of it.', '2006-04-07 10:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294616, 317785, 16241, '<td valign="top">yum</td>', 'yum', '2006-04-07 10:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294619, 317785, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective. Unusual and the DOF is spot on.  Great use of light and the way off centered focus is excellent.</td>', 'I like the perspective. Unusual and the DOF is spot on.  Great use of light and the way off centered focus is excellent.', '2006-04-07 10:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294624, 317769, 16241, '<td valign="top">great hands!</td>', 'great hands!', '2006-04-07 10:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294625, 317633, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The greens are lovely. Her hair cascading down in its wavy fashion helps add to the shot. The duplicity of the trees works well to create a pattern. Nice DOF.</td>', 'I like this.  The greens are lovely. Her hair cascading down in its wavy fashion helps add to the shot. The duplicity of the trees works well to create a pattern. Nice DOF.', '2006-04-07 10:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294626, 317665, 16241, '<td valign="top">great texture!  clean, bright, wtg</td>', 'great texture!  clean, bright, wtg', '2006-04-07 10:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294630, 317665, 15711, '<td valign="top">OH cool.  Unusual!!! I like it. The zig zag of the barricade works well against the gray wall.</td>', 'OH cool.  Unusual!!! I like it. The zig zag of the barricade works well against the gray wall.', '2006-04-07 10:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
