(2294880, 317769, 49211, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what it is about a great photo of working hands that I always have to give a 10. Maybe it''s that it fits the challenge perfect, and it shows something valuable at the same time. Excellent work. From the detail to the dof to the composition, everything about this images is perfect in my eyes.</td>', 'I''m not sure what it is about a great photo of working hands that I always have to give a 10. Maybe it''s that it fits the challenge perfect, and it shows something valuable at the same time. Excellent work. From the detail to the dof to the composition, everything about this images is perfect in my eyes.', '2006-04-07 12:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
