(2294898, 314786, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too contrasty for me. There is very little midtone detail. I really dislike the pink color cast that I''m seeing on my monitor. With an extra light pointed more toward the background you could have eliminated quite a bit of the harsh shadows under the ribbon. This looks like a case where the camera was fooled by the white background, thus the lack of good detail in the dark vegetation. Shooting a subject with a great deal of tonal contrast can be tricky because of the different exposure requirements. In this case, capturing the texture of the vegetation should take precedent. Nice effort.</td>', 'This is a bit too contrasty for me. There is very little midtone detail. I really dislike the pink color cast that I''m seeing on my monitor. With an extra light pointed more toward the background you could have eliminated quite a bit of the harsh shadows under the ribbon. This looks like a case where the camera was fooled by the white background, thus the lack of good detail in the dark vegetation. Shooting a subject with a great deal of tonal contrast can be tricky because of the different exposure requirements. In this case, capturing the texture of the vegetation should take precedent. Nice effort.', '2006-04-07 12:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294903, 314780, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture detail. The eye looks fabulous. I like the quirky cropping. It seems a tad contrasty to me in the area of the sheep''s face.</td>', 'Very nice texture detail. The eye looks fabulous. I like the quirky cropping. It seems a tad contrasty to me in the area of the sheep''s face.', '2006-04-07 12:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294906, 317057, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice freeze and an overall good photo but not quite capturing the texture, IMO. The flowers are a bit overexposed and I''m not seeing much textural detail in the bee.</td>', 'Nice freeze and an overall good photo but not quite capturing the texture, IMO. The flowers are a bit overexposed and I''m not seeing much textural detail in the bee.', '2006-04-07 12:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294914, 314385, 7322, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks a bit flat. While I''m seeing lots of lines indicating texture, I''m not quite getting the ''feel'' of the feathers. The glossy, luminous quality is missing in this.</td>', 'The lighting looks a bit flat. While I''m seeing lots of lines indicating texture, I''m not quite getting the ''feel'' of the feathers. The glossy, luminous quality is missing in this.', '2006-04-07 12:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294917, 317750, 49211, '<td valign="top">It''s an hour from lunch time and now I''m really hungry so I should give you a 1!! But I didn''t. Nice thinking for this one. I like the creativeness you used. It really does show great texture with the soft melting butter soaking in, and the lightly browned tips have a nice crunchy look. Gosh I bet that would taste good right now!</td>', 'It''s an hour from lunch time and now I''m really hungry so I should give you a 1!! But I didn''t. Nice thinking for this one. I like the creativeness you used. It really does show great texture with the soft melting butter soaking in, and the lightly browned tips have a nice crunchy look. Gosh I bet that would taste good right now!', '2006-04-07 12:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294920, 317786, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I think the DOF is a bit too shallow though. That is somewhat a matter of opinion though. Lots of people like this sort of extreme blurring of foreground and background (bokeh?).</td>', 'Interesting. I think the DOF is a bit too shallow though. That is somewhat a matter of opinion though. Lots of people like this sort of extreme blurring of foreground and background (bokeh?).', '2006-04-07 12:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294924, 317597, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and decent capture of texture. I''m never crazy about extremely narrow cropping though.</td>', 'Interesting subject and decent capture of texture. I''m never crazy about extremely narrow cropping though.', '2006-04-07 12:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294932, 317772, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is just too grainy, soft, and murky to me. I don''t really get a sense that I''m looking at anything.</td>', 'This is just too grainy, soft, and murky to me. I don''t really get a sense that I''m looking at anything.', '2006-04-07 12:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294953, 314802, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is weird. I can''t figure out what the black, shiny blob in the palm is. The missing digit really makes this odd. At first glance I thought this was a baseball glove. It''s a very good capture of texture, I''ll give you that. :D Very good lighting. I just don''t relate to the asthetic (and I''ve been missing 1/4" of my right middle finger since I was 6 :D).</td>', 'This is weird. I can''t figure out what the black, shiny blob in the palm is. The missing digit really makes this odd. At first glance I thought this was a baseball glove. It''s a very good capture of texture, I''ll give you that. :D Very good lighting. I just don''t relate to the asthetic (and I''ve been missing 1/4" of my right middle finger since I was 6 :D).', '2006-04-07 12:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294967, 317190, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very good portrait and a handsome subject. Very direct and intelligent gaze. It draws you in. Great capture of the texture.  Those look like the eyebrows of a Scot or Irishman. I wonder if I''m correct? :D  I''m not finished voting but this should be in the top 5.</td>', 'Very good portrait and a handsome subject. Very direct and intelligent gaze. It draws you in. Great capture of the texture.  Those look like the eyebrows of a Scot or Irishman. I wonder if I''m correct? :D  I''m not finished voting but this should be in the top 5.', '2006-04-07 12:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294976, 317326, 7322, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and great capture of detail. I''m not crazy about this composition. I would rather see the smaller flanking one of the other shells rather than placed in the middle. I feel like the shells should be arranged to form the classic triangle shape a still-life painting. This arrangement looks a bit literal and soldierly to me. Also, I''m not sure if the reflections work that well, although they probably would if the shells were arranged more as a group.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and great capture of detail. I''m not crazy about this composition. I would rather see the smaller flanking one of the other shells rather than placed in the middle. I feel like the shells should be arranged to form the classic triangle shape a still-life painting. This arrangement looks a bit literal and soldierly to me. Also, I''m not sure if the reflections work that well, although they probably would if the shells were arranged more as a group.', '2006-04-07 12:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294983, 317780, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the exposure is good, if a bit contrasty. I think it could be cropped a bit at the top and bottom edges.</td>', 'I like the subject and the exposure is good, if a bit contrasty. I think it could be cropped a bit at the top and bottom edges.', '2006-04-07 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294985, 317797, 48954, '<td valign="top">amazing, i hope you ribbon. you have my 10</td>', 'amazing, i hope you ribbon. you have my 10', '2006-04-07 12:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294992, 317122, 7322, '<td valign="top">A little too contrast for me but good cropping.</td>', 'A little too contrast for me but good cropping.', '2006-04-07 12:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2294997, 316726, 7322, '<td valign="top">Colorful and fun subject matter. I like the composition. I think there is a bit too much glare and shadow though.</td>', 'Colorful and fun subject matter. I like the composition. I think there is a bit too much glare and shadow though.', '2006-04-07 12:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295002, 316685, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very good exposure and image quality. I like the color. I''m not crazy about the horizontal format. I wonder if this would be better rotated 90 degrees clockwise?</td>', 'Very good exposure and image quality. I like the color. I''m not crazy about the horizontal format. I wonder if this would be better rotated 90 degrees clockwise?', '2006-04-07 12:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295004, 316307, 39349, '<td valign="top">Ladies and Gentlemen we have the blue right here. AMAZING! In every single way. I''m honored to even be in the same challenge as this work of art. Beautiful, simply beautiful.</td>', 'Ladies and Gentlemen we have the blue right here. AMAZING! In every single way. I''m honored to even be in the same challenge as this work of art. Beautiful, simply beautiful.', '2006-04-07 12:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295006, 316307, 48954, '<td valign="top">This better get blue or i''ll be annoyed for you hehe. THis is an mazing shot. 10.<br/> <br/>I do have a few questions though:<br/>1-how did you edit this shot?<br/>2- did you ask permission to take that ladie''s photo and if so, was she more than happy to "pose"? I have this great fear of taking candid shots and i''m always affraid that people won''t like it if i take pictures of them etc.<br/> <br/>GOOD LUCK&gt; I HOPE YOU WIN!</td>', 'This better get blue or i''ll be annoyed for you hehe. THis is an mazing shot. 10. I do have a few questions though:1-how did you edit this shot?2- did you ask permission to take that ladie''s photo and if so, was she more than happy to "pose"? I have this great fear of taking candid shots and i''m always affraid that people won''t like it if i take pictures of them etc. GOOD LUCK> I HOPE YOU WIN!', '2006-04-07 12:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295010, 315383, 48954, '<td valign="top">This is very cool, but why is the front out of focus? This would do alot better if all of it was in focus.</td>', 'This is very cool, but why is the front out of focus? This would do alot better if all of it was in focus.', '2006-04-07 12:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295011, 315575, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and detail. Since this is Advanced Editing, I would have cloned out the bits in the top and lower left corners of the frame for a completely black background. I don''t care for the thin red border.</td>', 'Very nice color and detail. Since this is Advanced Editing, I would have cloned out the bits in the top and lower left corners of the frame for a completely black background. I don''t care for the thin red border.', '2006-04-07 12:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295016, 317361, 48954, '<td valign="top">very funny. how did you get the cat to lick the glass? liquid catnip? Theproblem i have with this shot is the weird flat top that the cat has. It looks a little to edited/weird. BUt very cool photo idea. Good luck.</td>', 'very funny. how did you get the cat to lick the glass? liquid catnip? Theproblem i have with this shot is the weird flat top that the cat has. It looks a little to edited/weird. BUt very cool photo idea. Good luck.', '2006-04-07 12:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295019, 317747, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition but I don''t think the image quality is quite there.It seems like it could be sharper. This photo doesn''t really seem to be about exploring texture. I''m getting very little sense of texture from it.</td>', 'This is a nice composition but I don''t think the image quality is quite there.It seems like it could be sharper. This photo doesn''t really seem to be about exploring texture. I''m getting very little sense of texture from it.', '2006-04-07 12:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295024, 317324, 48954, '<td valign="top">Normally i find shot like this borring cause there''s "nothing" to look at. But there is something about this shot that makes it very interesting i find. the lighting perhaps? can''t quite figure it out. Good luck</td>', 'Normally i find shot like this borring cause there''s "nothing" to look at. But there is something about this shot that makes it very interesting i find. the lighting perhaps? can''t quite figure it out. Good luck', '2006-04-07 12:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295026, 317711, 54446, '<td valign="top">Nothing in focus here.</td>', 'Nothing in focus here.', '2006-04-07 12:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295029, 315953, 48954, '<td valign="top">i see there is growing superhero trend hehe. good luck</td>', 'i see there is growing superhero trend hehe. good luck', '2006-04-07 12:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295032, 316100, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very little of this image is in focus.  At least, it''s not in focus where it needs to be.</td>', 'Very little of this image is in focus.  At least, it''s not in focus where it needs to be.', '2006-04-07 12:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295033, 317760, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the saturated colors of the boys clothes in contrast to the more neutral background. His skin has that overly smooth, plastic-looking processed quality that I find disturbing though. The composition is a bit weird to me.</td>', 'I like the saturated colors of the boys clothes in contrast to the more neutral background. His skin has that overly smooth, plastic-looking processed quality that I find disturbing though. The composition is a bit weird to me.', '2006-04-07 12:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295036, 316587, 49211, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I want to know how you got the water to move in it and take a picture with nothing else in the view.</td>', 'Great shot! I want to know how you got the water to move in it and take a picture with nothing else in the view.', '2006-04-07 12:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295037, 316596, 54446, '<td valign="top">Looks all blurred to me.  At least some of the image needs to be in focus.</td>', 'Looks all blurred to me.  At least some of the image needs to be in focus.', '2006-04-07 12:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295038, 317403, 48954, '<td valign="top">very good colour contrast. the idea has been done before, but this the best i''ve seen until now on this site. good job.</td>', 'very good colour contrast. the idea has been done before, but this the best i''ve seen until now on this site. good job.', '2006-04-07 12:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295040, 317772, 54446, '<td valign="top">Electronic noise is a problem. Also, nothing seems to be in focus.  I don''t know what this is.</td>', 'Electronic noise is a problem. Also, nothing seems to be in focus.  I don''t know what this is.', '2006-04-07 12:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295045, 317487, 54446, '<td valign="top">Might be overprocessed.  The white areas, caught by the sunlight, appear to be oversharpening artifacts.  The important fact is I can''t really tell.  Lots of speckles and/or electronic noise.</td>', 'Might be overprocessed.  The white areas, caught by the sunlight, appear to be oversharpening artifacts.  The important fact is I can''t really tell.  Lots of speckles and/or electronic noise.', '2006-04-07 13:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295047, 317622, 7322, '<td valign="top">His eyes look very lifeless to me. I''m seeing reflections of what could be flash in the pupils so maybe that is the problem. There isn''t enough area in sharp focus to really get a sense of the furry texture. The cropping is good.</td>', 'His eyes look very lifeless to me. I''m seeing reflections of what could be flash in the pupils so maybe that is the problem. There isn''t enough area in sharp focus to really get a sense of the furry texture. The cropping is good.', '2006-04-07 13:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295048, 317012, 48954, '<td valign="top">this looks like a painting. very good. Too bad that there isn''t something other than clouds to make it a little more interesting; like a bird or something to give the whole more "story" or something of the sort. Good luck</td>', 'this looks like a painting. very good. Too bad that there isn''t something other than clouds to make it a little more interesting; like a bird or something to give the whole more "story" or something of the sort. Good luck', '2006-04-07 13:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295053, 316036, 48954, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2006-04-07 13:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295054, 317805, 42615, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I have trouble getting detail on my black cat.  This looks just like here (right down to the runny right eye)  nice capture.</td>', 'Nice picture, I have trouble getting detail on my black cat.  This looks just like here (right down to the runny right eye)  nice capture.', '2006-04-07 13:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295058, 314802, 49211, '<td valign="top">ummm, It looks like there''s something missing. At least one anyway. Great shot though.</td>', 'ummm, It looks like there''s something missing. At least one anyway. Great shot though.', '2006-04-07 13:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295060, 317288, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail. I wish the background were either very black or very white. I''m not crazy about this slate color that I''m getting on my monitor. I think because it is very similar in tone to the rest of the image and I''d like to see the flower pop out more from the background.</td>', 'Very nice detail. I wish the background were either very black or very white. I''m not crazy about this slate color that I''m getting on my monitor. I think because it is very similar in tone to the rest of the image and I''d like to see the flower pop out more from the background.', '2006-04-07 13:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295062, 317826, 48954, '<td valign="top">interesting idea but the image lacks "sharpness" and the feather could have used a little more grooming hehe. Advanced editing...I would cloned out the distracting little things like the hair in the bottom left corner or the fold in the feather. that could have make it look more groomed. good luck</td>', 'interesting idea but the image lacks "sharpness" and the feather could have used a little more grooming hehe. Advanced editing...I would cloned out the distracting little things like the hair in the bottom left corner or the fold in the feather. that could have make it look more groomed. good luck', '2006-04-07 13:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295070, 315439, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think for this sort of study, a much tighter crop is necessary. We don''t really need to see the grass and other trees in the background, even in blur.</td>', 'I think for this sort of study, a much tighter crop is necessary. We don''t really need to see the grass and other trees in the background, even in blur.', '2006-04-07 13:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295072, 317544, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and image quality. Good capture of the burning twine. Perhaps a more square crop though?</td>', 'Very nice lighting and image quality. Good capture of the burning twine. Perhaps a more square crop though?', '2006-04-07 13:05:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2295084, 317287, 48954, '<td valign="top">Wow. crazy detail. very nice. I know most people don''t think it s an issue, but the title...I would have simply called it "Lizardus Texturus". There is no need to specify "backyard lizard" in my opinion. titles are important in my opinion because they help convey the message. Or maybe....you are making a "Road Runner, Wyluie Coyote" reference here... Anyways, bottom line: very nice shot. good luck</td>', 'Wow. crazy detail. very nice. I know most people don''t think it s an issue, but the title...I would have simply called it "Lizardus Texturus". There is no need to specify "backyard lizard" in my opinion. titles are important in my opinion because they help convey the message. Or maybe....you are making a "Road Runner, Wyluie Coyote" reference here... Anyways, bottom line: very nice shot. good luck', '2006-04-07 13:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295097, 317665, 48954, '<td valign="top">very good composition</td>', 'very good composition', '2006-04-07 13:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295099, 315373, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting but it seems to be more of a study of reflections than texture. Although, on second thought, the reflections are there because of the texture so I guess this works. Still, for a challenge which, in my view,  is essentially a technical one, I think the textural quality should be more apparent. I''m not crazy about this type of subject matter but the reflections of the clouds, trees, and monument add interest and mood. The reflections of the vistors at the bottom, however are merely distracting and should have been cropped out, IMO.</td>', 'Interesting but it seems to be more of a study of reflections than texture. Although, on second thought, the reflections are there because of the texture so I guess this works. Still, for a challenge which, in my view,  is essentially a technical one, I think the textural quality should be more apparent. I''m not crazy about this type of subject matter but the reflections of the clouds, trees, and monument add interest and mood. The reflections of the vistors at the bottom, however are merely distracting and should have been cropped out, IMO.', '2006-04-07 13:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295105, 315697, 7322, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the eye and nice cropping. The highlights are a bit blown out for me. I''d like to see a bit more detail in those areas.</td>', 'Great capture of the eye and nice cropping. The highlights are a bit blown out for me. I''d like to see a bit more detail in those areas.', '2006-04-07 13:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295109, 316381, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice color and textural detail. Interesting cropping.</td>', 'Nice color and textural detail. Interesting cropping.', '2006-04-07 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295112, 314287, 7322, '<td valign="top">A little dark and contrasty (especially at the top edge) but I like the colors and the cropping. I think if most of the top edge where it is really underexposed were cropped out, leaving just a narrow strip of darkness, it would improve quite a bit.</td>', 'A little dark and contrasty (especially at the top edge) but I like the colors and the cropping. I think if most of the top edge where it is really underexposed were cropped out, leaving just a narrow strip of darkness, it would improve quite a bit.', '2006-04-07 13:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295116, 315152, 7322, '<td valign="top">The sky looks great. I like the composition and the subject matter. It is a bit contrasty but in this case, I think it works. Since this is an advanced editing challenge I would have cloned out the bit of tree at the edge.</td>', 'The sky looks great. I like the composition and the subject matter. It is a bit contrasty but in this case, I think it works. Since this is an advanced editing challenge I would have cloned out the bit of tree at the edge.', '2006-04-07 13:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295122, 317774, 7322, '<td valign="top">I generally find this to be boring subject matter but this is very well done. I think I would have left a little bit more negative space near the top to allow the flame a bit of breathing room.</td>', 'I generally find this to be boring subject matter but this is very well done. I think I would have left a little bit more negative space near the top to allow the flame a bit of breathing room.', '2006-04-07 13:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295125, 316100, 7322, '<td valign="top">Quite a bit blown out in the highlights and more of the subject should be in sharp focus, IMO.</td>', 'Quite a bit blown out in the highlights and more of the subject should be in sharp focus, IMO.', '2006-04-07 13:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295127, 317214, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture. I really like how the bird adds scale and interest to the main subject. I really hope all that white stuff dripping down isn''t years of bird turd!</td>', 'Very interesting capture. I really like how the bird adds scale and interest to the main subject. I really hope all that white stuff dripping down isn''t years of bird turd!', '2006-04-07 13:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295129, 315370, 7322, '<td valign="top">Oohh...very lovely texture and color. Great capture and excellent cropping.</td>', 'Oohh...very lovely texture and color. Great capture and excellent cropping.', '2006-04-07 13:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295130, 315944, 7322, '<td valign="top">A little too much of the frame is in blur and shadow for my taste.</td>', 'A little too much of the frame is in blur and shadow for my taste.', '2006-04-07 13:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295134, 317802, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Unlike many of the shots with similar subject matter, which have appeared to contrasty to me, this appears to have a good amount of tonal range. I like the way the seedlings stand out sharply against the dark background.</td>', 'Very nice. Unlike many of the shots with similar subject matter, which have appeared to contrasty to me, this appears to have a good amount of tonal range. I like the way the seedlings stand out sharply against the dark background.', '2006-04-07 13:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295139, 317361, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very funny and great textural detail. I think I recognize this fellow from other photos.  How do you get him to pose so well? My cats are usually very uncooporative. :D</td>', 'Very funny and great textural detail. I think I recognize this fellow from other photos.  How do you get him to pose so well? My cats are usually very uncooporative. :D', '2006-04-07 13:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295141, 317699, 31443, '<td valign="top">Fascinating machine and you''ve caught the texture in a very special way</td>', 'Fascinating machine and you''ve caught the texture in a very special way', '2006-04-07 13:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295146, 315885, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice texture kitty ;)</td>', 'Nice texture kitty ;)', '2006-04-07 13:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295150, 317662, 7322, '<td valign="top">Eek! I have pretty great skin for my age (38) so this isn''t exactly my nightmare (mine always involove losing teeth). This is really well done. Great exposure and excellent image quality. Even though it''s a phony set-up, it makes sense and works asthetically outside the challenge.  I will be surprised if this doesn''t ribbon.</td>', 'Eek! I have pretty great skin for my age (38) so this isn''t exactly my nightmare (mine always involove losing teeth). This is really well done. Great exposure and excellent image quality. Even though it''s a phony set-up, it makes sense and works asthetically outside the challenge.  I will be surprised if this doesn''t ribbon.', '2006-04-07 13:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295151, 317576, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Not crazy about what appears to be selective desaturation though.</td>', 'Very nice. Not crazy about what appears to be selective desaturation though.', '2006-04-07 13:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295152, 316354, 31443, '<td valign="top">I love seeing creativity at work, this is amazing..</td>', 'I love seeing creativity at work, this is amazing..', '2006-04-07 13:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295155, 317719, 36808, '<td valign="top">a little blurry on the left, but still very awesome!<br/>good luck.  :)</td>', 'a little blurry on the left, but still very awesome!good luck.  :)', '2006-04-07 13:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295157, 317427, 7322, '<td valign="top">A very charming candid portrait. In terms of texture this has a nice range--the stone, the boy''s very youthful skin, and his spikey hair. One of my tops.</td>', 'A very charming candid portrait. In terms of texture this has a nice range--the stone, the boy''s very youthful skin, and his spikey hair. One of my tops.', '2006-04-07 13:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295162, 317806, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic color and great detail. I love the contrast the black background gives.</td>', 'Very dramatic color and great detail. I love the contrast the black background gives.', '2006-04-07 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295163, 314397, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the sepia but this shows great skin and hair texture and his eyes are penetrating. His face looks slightly distorted to me.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the sepia but this shows great skin and hair texture and his eyes are penetrating. His face looks slightly distorted to me.', '2006-04-07 13:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295164, 316307, 36808, '<td valign="top">I love this. Composition, shadows, light, wrinkles and smoothness.  Truly beautiful and best of challenge from me.  Good luck!</td>', 'I love this. Composition, shadows, light, wrinkles and smoothness.  Truly beautiful and best of challenge from me.  Good luck!', '2006-04-07 13:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295167, 317665, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice tonal range in this image and I really like teh contrast of the orange against the concrete. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice tonal range in this image and I really like teh contrast of the orange against the concrete. Well done.', '2006-04-07 13:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295170, 317459, 36808, '<td valign="top">lovely.  looks like a watercolor.</td>', 'lovely.  looks like a watercolor.', '2006-04-07 13:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295172, 317313, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing this as an exploration of texture so much as pattern. As a candid it works well for me but I don''t think it is really suitable for this challenge.</td>', 'I''m not seeing this as an exploration of texture so much as pattern. As a candid it works well for me but I don''t think it is really suitable for this challenge.', '2006-04-07 13:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295182, 317750, 36808, '<td valign="top">Yum!</td>', 'Yum!', '2006-04-07 13:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295183, 316307, 55822, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. The womans face and hands tell everything. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'I love this shot. The womans face and hands tell everything. Beautiful shot.', '2006-04-07 13:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295195, 317809, 17291, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible photo. You met the challenge well. I gave it a 10.</td>', 'This is an incredible photo. You met the challenge well. I gave it a 10.', '2006-04-07 13:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295233, 317349, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, pretty model. I do get the feeling she is  a little tense standing in that position with her arm up and her hand behind her head, it seems like she is forcing herself to keep the hand there. Maybe if she had stood a little bit further out from the wall and leaned back against it to bring in a more relaxed feel to the image.</td>', 'Nice shot, pretty model. I do get the feeling she is  a little tense standing in that position with her arm up and her hand behind her head, it seems like she is forcing herself to keep the hand there. Maybe if she had stood a little bit further out from the wall and leaned back against it to bring in a more relaxed feel to the image.', '2006-04-07 14:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295254, 317535, 5728, '<td valign="top">The toning here is very effective, I like these color tones a lot. Lighting is also done well. Somehow this image doesn''t really have the kick to it that it should though. The main subject is great, the background is okay, it fits. But I would probably have gone in for something with more impact to it, maybe a different angle or composition I don''t know exactly. It just needs more kick to it.</td>', 'The toning here is very effective, I like these color tones a lot. Lighting is also done well. Somehow this image doesn''t really have the kick to it that it should though. The main subject is great, the background is okay, it fits. But I would probably have gone in for something with more impact to it, maybe a different angle or composition I don''t know exactly. It just needs more kick to it.', '2006-04-07 14:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295257, 316307, 5728, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue ribbon, this is really a work of art. Going immediately into my favourites. Only one person can do work like this, right Manny :)</td>', 'Congratulations on your blue ribbon, this is really a work of art. Going immediately into my favourites. Only one person can do work like this, right Manny :)', '2006-04-07 14:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
