(2296032, 316354, 39057, '<td valign="top">This is a very good shot. However, I gave this a 6. I may come back to score higher but I''m not sure. There are many good texture shots in the challenge that truly show "genuine" texture of an "object". While this shot shows much "texture", the texture looks processed or "painted in". I know this is advanced editing and almost anything is fair game, but I''m not sure how to score this against the other shots in the challenge. <br/> <br/>On a "free study" challenge I would give this a 10 or even 11 if that were possible. On the texture challenge I''ll start with a 6 and come back later.<br/> <br/>Good Luck,</td>', 'This is a very good shot. However, I gave this a 6. I may come back to score higher but I''m not sure. There are many good texture shots in the challenge that truly show "genuine" texture of an "object". While this shot shows much "texture", the texture looks processed or "painted in". I know this is advanced editing and almost anything is fair game, but I''m not sure how to score this against the other shots in the challenge.  On a "free study" challenge I would give this a 10 or even 11 if that were possible. On the texture challenge I''ll start with a 6 and come back later. Good Luck,', '2006-04-07 19:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
