(2296602, 315784, 43031, '<td valign="top">Wow, so much to go over. First off, go over to www.photoinf.com and look up this article: //www.photoinf.com/General/Johannes_Vloothuis/landscape_composition_rules.html<br/> <br/>Pay special attention to #21 and #22 for this picture. Yes, it is a painting article, but the pricinples translate.<br/> <br/>Read the rest of the stuff on the site, it''s all great, and some of it crosses over and repeats, but it will all help you with your photography.</td>', 'Wow, so much to go over. First off, go over to www.photoinf.com and look up this article: //www.photoinf.com/General/Johannes_Vloothuis/landscape_composition_rules.html Pay special attention to #21 and #22 for this picture. Yes, it is a painting article, but the pricinples translate. Read the rest of the stuff on the site, it''s all great, and some of it crosses over and repeats, but it will all help you with your photography.', '2006-04-08 00:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
