(2296809, 315876, 15511, '<td valign="top">The upper 1/5 of the image detracts because it''s out of focus, and the glare from the sky removes the mood from the foreground. I like the bottom 2/3 of your image.</td>', 'The upper 1/5 of the image detracts because it''s out of focus, and the glare from the sky removes the mood from the foreground. I like the bottom 2/3 of your image.', '2006-04-08 02:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296830, 315290, 27164, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.', '2006-04-08 02:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296850, 317321, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wowsers!!! This is incredible! You have really put together the total package here. I mean, this like goes beyond macro! So, you''ve got the extreme close up, amazing detail thing going on. Then you''ve got the fiercely strong, in your face composition. And you''ve got these sweet colors happening. And on top of it all, awesome lighting, ...and...talk about texture. I feel like if I put my fingers on the screen, I could feel that guy! Aaaannddddd....interest factor??? Man, fahget abowt it! :-P I could look at this all night! You know, usually, some bug macros are kinda cool, but for the most part, I''m normally like, yeah, that''s good, but, anh. This shot though is just the bomb, man. Fav, 10, sign me up, yeah!!! <br/>....oh, and...nice shot :-)</td>', 'Wowsers!!! This is incredible! You have really put together the total package here. I mean, this like goes beyond macro! So, you''ve got the extreme close up, amazing detail thing going on. Then you''ve got the fiercely strong, in your face composition. And you''ve got these sweet colors happening. And on top of it all, awesome lighting, ...and...talk about texture. I feel like if I put my fingers on the screen, I could feel that guy! Aaaannddddd....interest factor??? Man, fahget abowt it! :-P I could look at this all night! You know, usually, some bug macros are kinda cool, but for the most part, I''m normally like, yeah, that''s good, but, anh. This shot though is just the bomb, man. Fav, 10, sign me up, yeah!!! ....oh, and...nice shot :-)', '2006-04-08 02:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296852, 316307, 21621, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue ribbon Librodo.  This is a fantastic and inspiring photo, great work.</td>', 'Congratulations on your blue ribbon Librodo.  This is a fantastic and inspiring photo, great work.', '2006-04-08 02:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296858, 317015, 21621, '<td valign="top">No room for improvement here, super shot, should ribbon.</td>', 'No room for improvement here, super shot, should ribbon.', '2006-04-08 02:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296860, 316307, 19831, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph! Quite a daring composition, yet very effective. Your choice of subject here is of course, awesome. Years and years of texture there to study. I love the processing of the image. Very fitting is an understatement. Wow, the longer I look, the more and more I like. An amazing photo, well done, indeed :-)</td>', 'Stunning photograph! Quite a daring composition, yet very effective. Your choice of subject here is of course, awesome. Years and years of texture there to study. I love the processing of the image. Very fitting is an understatement. Wow, the longer I look, the more and more I like. An amazing photo, well done, indeed :-)', '2006-04-08 02:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296877, 316134, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot here. Nicely composed, and great job on the exposure with the snow and all. Very nice catch of lighting there. A refreshing approach to this challenge, showing landscape texture. Nice job :-)</td>', 'Very cool shot here. Nicely composed, and great job on the exposure with the snow and all. Very nice catch of lighting there. A refreshing approach to this challenge, showing landscape texture. Nice job :-)', '2006-04-08 02:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296882, 317190, 3607, '<td valign="top">this is a really wonderful, incredible portrait (and photo).</td>', 'this is a really wonderful, incredible portrait (and photo).', '2006-04-08 02:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296887, 317686, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice capture - its really hard to take photos of objects in water like this.  i wonder if you could have fiddled with things a bit more to make it look like the swans were swimming through liquid silver/mercury (without going overboard of course).</td>', 'nice capture - its really hard to take photos of objects in water like this.  i wonder if you could have fiddled with things a bit more to make it look like the swans were swimming through liquid silver/mercury (without going overboard of course).', '2006-04-08 02:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296892, 317682, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Great natural abstract. Nice colors, great form and flow. I really like it. Nice job.</td>', 'Cool shot. Great natural abstract. Nice colors, great form and flow. I really like it. Nice job.', '2006-04-08 02:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2296905, 315697, 19831, '<td valign="top">Yup, you''re right, it''s a chicken. :-P</td>', 'Yup, you''re right, it''s a chicken. :-P', '2006-04-08 02:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297066, 316726, 31443, '<td valign="top">I like the gum drops, very nicely displayed, the glass however is not so attractive, maybe because it''s small or that there are too many lights reflecting on it...</td>', 'I like the gum drops, very nicely displayed, the glass however is not so attractive, maybe because it''s small or that there are too many lights reflecting on it...', '2006-04-08 05:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297068, 317190, 31443, '<td valign="top">Bristly yes, what a handsome guy though!</td>', 'Bristly yes, what a handsome guy though!', '2006-04-08 05:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297095, 317772, 50674, '<td valign="top">Could do with better focus, very unclear.</td>', 'Could do with better focus, very unclear.', '2006-04-08 06:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297096, 314733, 50674, '<td valign="top">I think focus on the flower itself would have helped here.</td>', 'I think focus on the flower itself would have helped here.', '2006-04-08 06:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297097, 315855, 23430, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, you''ve combined great texture with a very nice scene.</td>', 'Fantastic shot, you''ve combined great texture with a very nice scene.', '2006-04-08 06:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297098, 317558, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good subject and well photographed.</td>', 'Good subject and well photographed.', '2006-04-08 06:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297100, 317803, 23430, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. I think it might look better with an increase in the DOF to put all of the cactus in focus.</td>', 'I like this shot. I think it might look better with an increase in the DOF to put all of the cactus in focus.', '2006-04-08 06:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297103, 317323, 23430, '<td valign="top">It looks like you have reduced noise which also reduced detail and hidden the texture of the feathers else it''s just soft focus. Other than that it''s one of my favourite subjects and a very good composition.</td>', 'It looks like you have reduced noise which also reduced detail and hidden the texture of the feathers else it''s just soft focus. Other than that it''s one of my favourite subjects and a very good composition.', '2006-04-08 06:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297109, 315383, 23430, '<td valign="top">This would be perfect with the focus brought forward a tad. Other than that it''s a great subject and excellent lighting. I think the black background really works well. You can really feel the texture in this shot.</td>', 'This would be perfect with the focus brought forward a tad. Other than that it''s a great subject and excellent lighting. I think the black background really works well. You can really feel the texture in this shot.', '2006-04-08 06:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297111, 314339, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. It shows the texture very well.</td>', 'Good lighting. It shows the texture very well.', '2006-04-08 06:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297116, 317497, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice to see all the front of subject in focus. Good shot.</td>', 'Nice to see all the front of subject in focus. Good shot.', '2006-04-08 06:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297121, 317786, 23430, '<td valign="top">The small part in focus shows some texture well. The composition and colours are great. IMO if the DOF went from where it is to the tip of the shell at the front this shot would be greatly improved.</td>', 'The small part in focus shows some texture well. The composition and colours are great. IMO if the DOF went from where it is to the tip of the shell at the front this shot would be greatly improved.', '2006-04-08 06:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297125, 314977, 23430, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, I like the back lighting heaps. Quite a different subject as well. Looks sticky, very well done.</td>', 'Excellent composition, I like the back lighting heaps. Quite a different subject as well. Looks sticky, very well done.', '2006-04-08 06:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297130, 317222, 23430, '<td valign="top">This is an OK shot compositionally wise and with the movement of the truck adding interest but it doesn''t seem to be about texture.</td>', 'This is an OK shot compositionally wise and with the movement of the truck adding interest but it doesn''t seem to be about texture.', '2006-04-08 07:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297131, 317611, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great colours and composition. Lighting shows the texture fairly well though it does look a bit harsh or something. Good shot overall.</td>', 'Great colours and composition. Lighting shows the texture fairly well though it does look a bit harsh or something. Good shot overall.', '2006-04-08 07:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297133, 317617, 23430, '<td valign="top">I think a bigger DOF would improve this.</td>', 'I think a bigger DOF would improve this.', '2006-04-08 07:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297134, 317813, 23430, '<td valign="top">Not pretty/exciting but it''s definitely got texture and you''ve shown that up very well.</td>', 'Not pretty/exciting but it''s definitely got texture and you''ve shown that up very well.', '2006-04-08 07:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297135, 317303, 23430, '<td valign="top">Very textured in deed. Great composition.</td>', 'Very textured in deed. Great composition.', '2006-04-08 07:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297153, 317191, 42792, '<td valign="top">I really like this a lot and that''s why I had to leave a comment - original composition, a good play of different lines, shadow and forms, the colours are excellent.  Just don''t think it''s very fitting for the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this a lot and that''s why I had to leave a comment - original composition, a good play of different lines, shadow and forms, the colours are excellent.  Just don''t think it''s very fitting for the challenge.', '2006-04-08 07:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297155, 316597, 42792, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if the rim of the basket was equally sharp.</td>', 'Would have been better if the rim of the basket was equally sharp.', '2006-04-08 08:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297167, 315876, 32885, '<td valign="top">The ripples in the sand are great it is a pity about the distractions at the top of the image. I would have liked to see a much tighter crop. Perhaps the colour version might have had more impact too.</td>', 'The ripples in the sand are great it is a pity about the distractions at the top of the image. I would have liked to see a much tighter crop. Perhaps the colour version might have had more impact too.', '2006-04-08 08:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297169, 314264, 32885, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2006-04-08 08:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297170, 317679, 32885, '<td valign="top">A lovely image.</td>', 'A lovely image.', '2006-04-08 08:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297171, 317012, 32885, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I aprticularly ike the graduation of shading. Well doone.</td>', 'Nicely done. I aprticularly ike the graduation of shading. Well doone.', '2006-04-08 08:15:17.000000', NULL, 1);
