(2297366, 317191, 39057, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm very good shot. I will give a 6 to start because there are many shots in the challenge with very good "texture" in the subject. I like your shot, I can see the texture of the ground on the left and right but no real texture on what seems like the subject, the boardwalk or pier. <br/> <br/>I will come back after voting on the rest. This may go to an 8 but I will have to check out others.<br/> <br/>KS</td>', 'Hmmmm very good shot. I will give a 6 to start because there are many shots in the challenge with very good "texture" in the subject. I like your shot, I can see the texture of the ground on the left and right but no real texture on what seems like the subject, the boardwalk or pier.  I will come back after voting on the rest. This may go to an 8 but I will have to check out others. KS', '2006-04-08 10:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
