(2297887, 317288, 33560, '<td valign="top">I rarely think of the tulip in textural terms, but this is a good exception.</td>', 'I rarely think of the tulip in textural terms, but this is a good exception.', '2006-04-08 16:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297902, 317613, 33560, '<td valign="top">Cropped above the carrot, this is by far my favorite photo of cabbage. The crinkles and the many shades of green are quite marvelous.  Black background is goo.  As for the carrot, IMO that would be a 2 pt deduction if it could not so easily be chopped off the photo, Even if it might have added color or some other quality to the composition, the blown  highlignts ( or just about ) is the last thing to include in a photo about texture... Sorry about the rant, I like the cabbage.</td>', 'Cropped above the carrot, this is by far my favorite photo of cabbage. The crinkles and the many shades of green are quite marvelous.  Black background is goo.  As for the carrot, IMO that would be a 2 pt deduction if it could not so easily be chopped off the photo, Even if it might have added color or some other quality to the composition, the blown  highlignts ( or just about ) is the last thing to include in a photo about texture... Sorry about the rant, I like the cabbage.', '2006-04-08 16:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297905, 317487, 33560, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  This made voting in this round worth every second.</td>', 'Stunning.  This made voting in this round worth every second.', '2006-04-08 16:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297907, 317827, 31443, '<td valign="top">Didn´t think this could be so interesting in texture..nice!</td>', 'Didn´t think this could be so interesting in texture..nice!', '2006-04-08 17:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297933, 317809, 39057, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm...two textures here...silky (water) and rough (rocks). Nice job.</td>', 'Hmmmm...two textures here...silky (water) and rough (rocks). Nice job.', '2006-04-08 17:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297960, 317125, 18197, '<td valign="top">Best of show in my opinion. Meets the challenge perfectly by making me feel the texture. Add to that that it''s well composed, lit, focused and avoided the trap of oversharpening. Well done! Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'Best of show in my opinion. Meets the challenge perfectly by making me feel the texture. Add to that that it''s well composed, lit, focused and avoided the trap of oversharpening. Well done! Hope it ribbons.', '2006-04-08 17:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297963, 315383, 18197, '<td valign="top">You''ve done an outstanding job making me feel the glistening texture of the critter. Lighting and reflections are terrific. I would have given one more point for slightly greater DOF, but no worries, it''s among my top picks.</td>', 'You''ve done an outstanding job making me feel the glistening texture of the critter. Lighting and reflections are terrific. I would have given one more point for slightly greater DOF, but no worries, it''s among my top picks.', '2006-04-08 17:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297967, 317021, 18197, '<td valign="top">I grew up playing on sandstone cliffs with rock similar to this. You have truly mastered the texture of the stone. Well done. There are a few minor focus issues around the edges that slightly greater DOF would take care of, but no worries, it''s among my top picks.</td>', 'I grew up playing on sandstone cliffs with rock similar to this. You have truly mastered the texture of the stone. Well done. There are a few minor focus issues around the edges that slightly greater DOF would take care of, but no worries, it''s among my top picks.', '2006-04-08 17:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297970, 317287, 18197, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly photographed. Although it feels just a little over sharpened, it does a beautiful job making me feel the texture of the lizard''s skin. Nice catch light in its eye. DOF (subject vs background) is very nice. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Brilliantly photographed. Although it feels just a little over sharpened, it does a beautiful job making me feel the texture of the lizard''s skin. Nice catch light in its eye. DOF (subject vs background) is very nice. Among my top picks.', '2006-04-08 17:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297976, 317810, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for ''shrooms and this is beautifully captured. Lighting is essentially perfect. Minimalist background focuses attention on subject. Well composed. The circular fringe of the cap serves to lead the eye back around to the stem, and then up to the underside where the detail is perfect. This is among my top picks for best of show. Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for ''shrooms and this is beautifully captured. Lighting is essentially perfect. Minimalist background focuses attention on subject. Well composed. The circular fringe of the cap serves to lead the eye back around to the stem, and then up to the underside where the detail is perfect. This is among my top picks for best of show. Hope it ribbons.', '2006-04-08 17:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297981, 317797, 18197, '<td valign="top">No question, you captured the rough texture of this critter. I can feel it almost as surely as if i were holding it. Colors are very good (both foreground and background). DOF does a nice job of focusing attention on your subject. I like that you''ve captured texture on several scales (big - the chin spines, medium - around the eyes and ear (?), and small - the somewhat grainy background and blurred foot.) Nice! Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'No question, you captured the rough texture of this critter. I can feel it almost as surely as if i were holding it. Colors are very good (both foreground and background). DOF does a nice job of focusing attention on your subject. I like that you''ve captured texture on several scales (big - the chin spines, medium - around the eyes and ear (?), and small - the somewhat grainy background and blurred foot.) Nice! Hope it ribbons.', '2006-04-08 17:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297983, 317682, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Not only have you captured texture in the small (surface texture) but you also caught texture in the large (variously colored flakes). I like that. Among my top 10 picks.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Not only have you captured texture in the small (surface texture) but you also caught texture in the large (variously colored flakes). I like that. Among my top 10 picks.', '2006-04-08 17:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297986, 314289, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured. I love how the rings lead the eye around the photo. Very nicely lit. Terrific DOF. I might have cropped a little tighter on the left and a little looser on the right, but no worries, it''s among my top 10 picks. Well done!</td>', 'Beautifully captured. I love how the rings lead the eye around the photo. Very nicely lit. Terrific DOF. I might have cropped a little tighter on the left and a little looser on the right, but no worries, it''s among my top 10 picks. Well done!', '2006-04-08 17:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2297994, 317012, 18197, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. I like its out-of-the-box nature. It does a very nice job of capturing the texture of the sky. I''m a pilot and I''ve seen a lot of sky. Well done! I fear that it won''t score as highly as I think it should because it employs a broader definition of texture than voters will appreciate. Hope I''m wrong. It''s among my top 10 and I hope it ribbons.</td>', 'I really like this photo. I like its out-of-the-box nature. It does a very nice job of capturing the texture of the sky. I''m a pilot and I''ve seen a lot of sky. Well done! I fear that it won''t score as highly as I think it should because it employs a broader definition of texture than voters will appreciate. Hope I''m wrong. It''s among my top 10 and I hope it ribbons.', '2006-04-08 17:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298001, 315855, 18197, '<td valign="top">I think I know this place, and if so, you have done a marvelous job catching it perfectly. Well done. I can truly feel the texture of the place ... part of it''s lighting, part composition, part colors. I am delighted you resisted over sharpening. The photo demonstrates a looser definition of texture that DPC voters may embrace. I fear it won''t be voted as highly as i think it should. I hope I''m wrong. Among my top 10. Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'I think I know this place, and if so, you have done a marvelous job catching it perfectly. Well done. I can truly feel the texture of the place ... part of it''s lighting, part composition, part colors. I am delighted you resisted over sharpening. The photo demonstrates a looser definition of texture that DPC voters may embrace. I fear it won''t be voted as highly as i think it should. I hope I''m wrong. Among my top 10. Hope it ribbons.', '2006-04-08 17:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298005, 317190, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great subject. Nicely composed and lit. Does a good job conveying emotion. But feels a little over sharpened to me. Hope it does well in the voting.</td>', 'Great subject. Nicely composed and lit. Does a good job conveying emotion. But feels a little over sharpened to me. Hope it does well in the voting.', '2006-04-08 17:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
