(2298012, 314796, 18197, '<td valign="top">Easy does it on the sharpening. This is just my opinion but to me it looks way over sharpened. Backing off a bit would have improved it.</td>', 'Easy does it on the sharpening. This is just my opinion but to me it looks way over sharpened. Backing off a bit would have improved it.', '2006-04-08 18:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
