(2298023, 314743, 18197, '<td valign="top">Easy does it on the sharpening. This is just my opinion but to me it looks over sharpened. Backing off a bit would have improved it.</td>', 'Easy does it on the sharpening. This is just my opinion but to me it looks over sharpened. Backing off a bit would have improved it.', '2006-04-08 18:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298028, 317323, 18197, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus would have improved this for me.</td>', 'Sharper focus would have improved this for me.', '2006-04-08 18:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298030, 317671, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot, but weak focus and blown highlights diminish it for me.</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot, but weak focus and blown highlights diminish it for me.', '2006-04-08 18:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298032, 317188, 18197, '<td valign="top">Easy does it on the sharpening. This is just my opinion but to me the foreground looks way over sharpened. Backing off a bit would have improved it.</td>', 'Easy does it on the sharpening. This is just my opinion but to me the foreground looks way over sharpened. Backing off a bit would have improved it.', '2006-04-08 18:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298039, 315829, 18197, '<td valign="top">This could have been an interesting shot. But lighting wasn''t your friend. The lighting is pretty harsh. It is from a direction that created minimal shadows, and hence the true texture wasn''t revealed very much. IMHO, this would have been a better photo in natural light near sunrise or sunset when the light is low in the sky. That would bring out the texture. I am also curious about the background, black in the photo. What would have been revealed with higher ambient light?</td>', 'This could have been an interesting shot. But lighting wasn''t your friend. The lighting is pretty harsh. It is from a direction that created minimal shadows, and hence the true texture wasn''t revealed very much. IMHO, this would have been a better photo in natural light near sunrise or sunset when the light is low in the sky. That would bring out the texture. I am also curious about the background, black in the photo. What would have been revealed with higher ambient light?', '2006-04-08 18:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298047, 316772, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry. There have been a bunch of pet-nose-pictures here lately. None of them have knocked my socks off. So this photo was handicapped from my point of view from the start. Having said that, it does a pretty good job making me feel the texture of the fur in the top 2/3 of the photo. It is well lit. Tonal range is good. And it avoids the all-too-common-sin in this challenge of over sharpening. Soft focus due to shallow DOF in the bottom 1/4 of the photo weakens the overal impact for me. You exhibited good technical talent with this. Keep shooting, learning and improving. And watch your scores improve!</td>', 'I''m sorry. There have been a bunch of pet-nose-pictures here lately. None of them have knocked my socks off. So this photo was handicapped from my point of view from the start. Having said that, it does a pretty good job making me feel the texture of the fur in the top 2/3 of the photo. It is well lit. Tonal range is good. And it avoids the all-too-common-sin in this challenge of over sharpening. Soft focus due to shallow DOF in the bottom 1/4 of the photo weakens the overal impact for me. You exhibited good technical talent with this. Keep shooting, learning and improving. And watch your scores improve!', '2006-04-08 18:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298049, 315681, 18197, '<td valign="top">Easy does it on the sharpening. This is just my opinion but to me it looks way over sharpened. Backing off a bit would have improved it.</td>', 'Easy does it on the sharpening. This is just my opinion but to me it looks way over sharpened. Backing off a bit would have improved it.', '2006-04-08 18:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2298083, 317773, 11960, '<td valign="top">That''s some sweet bokeh. =]</td>', 'That''s some sweet bokeh. =]', '2006-04-08 18:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
