(2301133, 317361, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Oh boy.  Cat looks familiar.  Good ''capture''.  Two main detractors here are the eyes (but they do ''add'' to the oddness), and likely due to the odd ''refraction'' and the ear chopped, otherwise, a unique shot and good take on the Challenge to show the texture of a cat''s tongue.  Nice complementary background colors.</td>', '7 - Oh boy.  Cat looks familiar.  Good ''capture''.  Two main detractors here are the eyes (but they do ''add'' to the oddness), and likely due to the odd ''refraction'' and the ear chopped, otherwise, a unique shot and good take on the Challenge to show the texture of a cat''s tongue.  Nice complementary background colors.', '2006-04-10 08:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2301135, 317583, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice shot.  Not sure on the toning color choice, but your call, obviously.  Good texture capture in the lamb.  Nice composition.</td>', '7 - Nice shot.  Not sure on the toning color choice, but your call, obviously.  Good texture capture in the lamb.  Nice composition.', '2006-04-10 08:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2301138, 316307, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good texture.  Can''t help wonder if color would have shown it even better.</td>', '8 - Good texture.  Can''t help wonder if color would have shown it even better.', '2006-04-10 08:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2301150, 317190, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Fairly good texture capture and nice portrait.  Like to see even more detail in the texture (for the Challenge), but I realize, being a portrait, it is perhaps not desired.  A tighter crop, especially on the right, likely have made this even better in my opinion and given a little more ''drama''.  Not sure on the ''effects'', especially in the clothing at the bottom.  Perhaps a variation in lighting too, although it could be the results of the filters/effects, not sure, just seems (the skin mainly) a little ''uneven'', but perhaps you were aiming for this.</td>', '7 - Fairly good texture capture and nice portrait.  Like to see even more detail in the texture (for the Challenge), but I realize, being a portrait, it is perhaps not desired.  A tighter crop, especially on the right, likely have made this even better in my opinion and given a little more ''drama''.  Not sure on the ''effects'', especially in the clothing at the bottom.  Perhaps a variation in lighting too, although it could be the results of the filters/effects, not sure, just seems (the skin mainly) a little ''uneven'', but perhaps you were aiming for this.', '2006-04-10 08:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2301159, 317277, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice.  Even with the 720(719) allowance, I''m sure this size doesn''t do this justice.  Nice concept and composition.  Perhaps a fraction more height, not sure, as does work well as is.  Dificult, but more definition in places make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Nice.  Even with the 720(719) allowance, I''m sure this size doesn''t do this justice.  Nice concept and composition.  Perhaps a fraction more height, not sure, as does work well as is.  Dificult, but more definition in places make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-10 08:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2301162, 317497, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very nice.  Colors look great together.  Nice composition and ''fade''.  Perhaps a little more height make this even better, not sure, might just be I''d like to see ''more''/bigger.  Fairly minor, but the slight grain back upper left ''softened'' too.  Nice.</td>', '9 - Very nice.  Colors look great together.  Nice composition and ''fade''.  Perhaps a little more height make this even better, not sure, might just be I''d like to see ''more''/bigger.  Fairly minor, but the slight grain back upper left ''softened'' too.  Nice.', '2006-04-10 08:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2301164, 317806, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good texture capture of this dying sunflower.  Few minor issues mainly bottom right ''fixed'' and perhaps a slight variation in composition (not sure, works well as is), make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Good texture capture of this dying sunflower.  Few minor issues mainly bottom right ''fixed'' and perhaps a slight variation in composition (not sure, works well as is), make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-10 08:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2301169, 317613, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good potential.  More carrots (and variation in lighting on them &amp;/or wetting them too), for added color and balance (else no carrot), a tighter crop, variation in composition (again for balance) and the ''something'' dark on the left removed/cropped out, make this even better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Good potential.  More carrots (and variation in lighting on them &/or wetting them too), for added color and balance (else no carrot), a tighter crop, variation in composition (again for balance) and the ''something'' dark on the left removed/cropped out, make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-04-10 09:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2301178, 314737, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice.  Like to see more texture detail in the petals as well (and even more in the sepals etc), but difficult I realize.  Nice colors and composition.</td>', '8 - Nice.  Like to see more texture detail in the petals as well (and even more in the sepals etc), but difficult I realize.  Nice colors and composition.', '2006-04-10 09:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2301181, 317301, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice.  Nice composition and colors.  Like to see a little more definition in the texture, but difficult. <i>edit:typo</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-14 00:26:20.</i></td>', '8 - Nice.  Nice composition and colors.  Like to see a little more definition in the texture, but difficult. edit:typo', '2006-04-10 09:09:33.000000', '2006-04-14 01:26:20.000000', 1),
