(2303042, 317012, 39349, '<td valign="top">Oh WOW! This shot is fantastic! I really do feel like I could reach out and touch these clouds, well done! 10 from me.</td>', 'Oh WOW! This shot is fantastic! I really do feel like I could reach out and touch these clouds, well done! 10 from me.', '2006-04-11 03:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
