(2303420, 314046, 42495, '<td valign="top">A bit hard to see the detail and texture of the ramp, but I like the idea.</td>', 'A bit hard to see the detail and texture of the ramp, but I like the idea.', '2006-04-11 11:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
