(2303653, 314397, 5728, '<td valign="top">Hey Bob, I think this face is quite well known on DPC :) Super shot!</td>', 'Hey Bob, I think this face is quite well known on DPC :) Super shot!', '2006-04-11 13:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303665, 315383, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good subject choice and nice execution!</td>', 'Very good subject choice and nice execution!', '2006-04-11 14:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303671, 317761, 30982, '<td valign="top">PERFECT title!  Love the look he/she is presenting to the camera.</td>', 'PERFECT title!  Love the look he/she is presenting to the camera.', '2006-04-11 14:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303673, 317303, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very interesting find!</td>', 'A very interesting find!', '2006-04-11 14:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303676, 314923, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy!  Would prefer a tighter crop on the subject - maybe take some off the left and bottom to leave the nice contrast in the upper right.</td>', 'Cute little guy!  Would prefer a tighter crop on the subject - maybe take some off the left and bottom to leave the nice contrast in the upper right.', '2006-04-11 14:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303678, 317627, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, very nice composition, great texture.</td>', 'Nice macro, very nice composition, great texture.', '2006-04-11 14:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303680, 317483, 30982, '<td valign="top">Composition is OK, but it''s an odd choice of subject and a just a bit "flat" in lighting/contrast.</td>', 'Composition is OK, but it''s an odd choice of subject and a just a bit "flat" in lighting/contrast.', '2006-04-11 14:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303684, 317546, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, definitely shows texture, but not the kind of macro I find appealing as a photograph.  Would be great for a science text, though!</td>', 'Good lighting, definitely shows texture, but not the kind of macro I find appealing as a photograph.  Would be great for a science text, though!', '2006-04-11 14:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303686, 317497, 30982, '<td valign="top">Color here is very well done.  Like the slight green in the foreground right, the dark orange red on the left.  Like the DOF used.</td>', 'Color here is very well done.  Like the slight green in the foreground right, the dark orange red on the left.  Like the DOF used.', '2006-04-11 14:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303688, 317558, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool idea for a subject!  Nice detail.</td>', 'Cool idea for a subject!  Nice detail.', '2006-04-11 14:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303692, 315829, 30982, '<td valign="top">Should be wearing a helmet... :-)  Not sure the focus here is on the texture.</td>', 'Should be wearing a helmet... :-)  Not sure the focus here is on the texture.', '2006-04-11 14:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303696, 317487, 30982, '<td valign="top">Incredible lighting or very good post processing, or both.  Really a great depiction of "texture".</td>', 'Incredible lighting or very good post processing, or both.  Really a great depiction of "texture".', '2006-04-11 14:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303703, 314733, 30982, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really say "texture" to me.  The tulip itself is a bit overexposed which masks its texture.</td>', 'Doesn''t really say "texture" to me.  The tulip itself is a bit overexposed which masks its texture.', '2006-04-11 14:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303704, 317427, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very good shot - would have been a great shot if those folks in the background had moved on before you took it.  I like the crop on the gargoyle thingie.</td>', 'A very good shot - would have been a great shot if those folks in the background had moved on before you took it.  I like the crop on the gargoyle thingie.', '2006-04-11 14:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303708, 315784, 30982, '<td valign="top">Overall the picture is rather "flat" - ie lacking in contrast/color.  I don''t care for the stone being centered, but that''s a personal preference.</td>', 'Overall the picture is rather "flat" - ie lacking in contrast/color.  I don''t care for the stone being centered, but that''s a personal preference.', '2006-04-11 14:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303713, 317576, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good macro, and definitely portrays the slimy texture of your subject well!</td>', 'Very good macro, and definitely portrays the slimy texture of your subject well!', '2006-04-11 14:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303785, 316307, 42495, '<td valign="top">The best of the challenge, IMHO.</td>', 'The best of the challenge, IMHO.', '2006-04-11 14:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303865, 314919, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Colors are really nice</td>', 'Nice capture! Colors are really nice', '2006-04-11 15:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2303870, 315373, 35994, '<td valign="top">This picture is absolutely gorgeous, the way the sky &amp; clouds reflect. Very nice shot!!</td>', 'This picture is absolutely gorgeous, the way the sky & clouds reflect. Very nice shot!!', '2006-04-11 15:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304139, 316857, 22748, '<td valign="top">The paint texture is interesting, but maybe some sidelighting and a tighter crop would increase the dramatic feel of the texture. The image feels a tad flat to me.</td>', 'The paint texture is interesting, but maybe some sidelighting and a tighter crop would increase the dramatic feel of the texture. The image feels a tad flat to me.', '2006-04-11 17:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304148, 317677, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the image very much. The lighting is good, the detail is there, and the angle of the log through the image adds interest (compared with if you had looked at the log from straight on the side or something).<br/> <br/>I don''t know what Mose is though, I think you mean Moss, but I think (I could be wrong) this is lichen. I wish people would be careful with their titles, it''s an important part of the presentation of your work.</td>', 'I like the image very much. The lighting is good, the detail is there, and the angle of the log through the image adds interest (compared with if you had looked at the log from straight on the side or something). I don''t know what Mose is though, I think you mean Moss, but I think (I could be wrong) this is lichen. I wish people would be careful with their titles, it''s an important part of the presentation of your work.', '2006-04-11 17:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304149, 317321, 22748, '<td valign="top">Holy schnikies! So sharp and crisp. Very very nice.</td>', 'Holy schnikies! So sharp and crisp. Very very nice.', '2006-04-11 17:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304155, 315784, 22748, '<td valign="top">I think there is potential, but the sky is uninteresting, and the texture is not clearly emphasized. Next time try getting closer, much much closer. Try getting only part of the rock. Try putting the rock in different parts of the frame. Maybe try getting a closer shot comparing the stone texture with the ground texture. Good luck!</td>', 'I think there is potential, but the sky is uninteresting, and the texture is not clearly emphasized. Next time try getting closer, much much closer. Try getting only part of the rock. Try putting the rock in different parts of the frame. Maybe try getting a closer shot comparing the stone texture with the ground texture. Good luck!', '2006-04-11 17:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304156, 316587, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great combination of object and environment. I like how the color of the water is emhasized.</td>', 'Great combination of object and environment. I like how the color of the water is emhasized.', '2006-04-11 17:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304158, 315290, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I love the smooth water and the rougher wood texture next to each other.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I love the smooth water and the rougher wood texture next to each other.', '2006-04-11 17:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304159, 317810, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome! Great detail, lighting, so perfect.</td>', 'Awesome! Great detail, lighting, so perfect.', '2006-04-11 17:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304168, 315148, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the contrast of the image, the lighting, and the simplicity of it all. The DOF is just right. Nice and crisp and clean image.</td>', 'I like the composition, the contrast of the image, the lighting, and the simplicity of it all. The DOF is just right. Nice and crisp and clean image.', '2006-04-11 17:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2304215, 317662, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great shot. One of my two favorite photos thus far.</td>', 'Great shot. One of my two favorite photos thus far.', '2006-04-11 18:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
