(2304608, 317765, 30605, '<td valign="top">Strange how the head of the lizard seems to sudently pop out of the fog. Transition seems too abrupt to be the result of shallow dof. I don''t know the reasons, but it is too distracting in my opinion; when looking at the photograph, I can''t get over the head appearing from nowhere. Makes it hard trying to appreciate the whole photograph.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-14 09:19:10.</i></td>', 'Strange how the head of the lizard seems to sudently pop out of the fog. Transition seems too abrupt to be the result of shallow dof. I don''t know the reasons, but it is too distracting in my opinion; when looking at the photograph, I can''t get over the head appearing from nowhere. Makes it hard trying to appreciate the whole photograph.', '2006-04-11 21:25:58.000000', '2006-04-14 10:19:10.000000', 1),
