(2308548, 317687, 509, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little harsh (it sort of looks like direct flash).  The textures are there and the subject &amp; teal coloring is good, but I''d prefer a framing/composition that makes the sloped portion at the top right flat (and consequently cropped out of the image) - the focus on that section is soft but its still a distraction b/c of the large amount of the image that it takes up (imho).</td>', 'Lighting is a little harsh (it sort of looks like direct flash).  The textures are there and the subject & teal coloring is good, but I''d prefer a framing/composition that makes the sloped portion at the top right flat (and consequently cropped out of the image) - the focus on that section is soft but its still a distraction b/c of the large amount of the image that it takes up (imho).', '2006-04-12 21:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308550, 315730, 509, '<td valign="top">Very sticky-looking  = )</td>', 'Very sticky-looking  = )', '2006-04-12 21:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308554, 315885, 509, '<td valign="top">I think this can work for textures, but with the editing done, it looks a little flat.  A little more saturation in the orange fur could help separate this from the background more imho.</td>', 'I think this can work for textures, but with the editing done, it looks a little flat.  A little more saturation in the orange fur could help separate this from the background more imho.', '2006-04-12 21:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308555, 317190, 48228, '<td valign="top">Wow.....</td>', 'Wow.....', '2006-04-12 21:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308558, 313976, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this quite fits for textures - it''s difficult to discern a 3-dimensional object here (it looks like it may be a screenshot).  In any case, the ''feeling'' (texture) of the image is lost on me.</td>', 'I''m not sure this quite fits for textures - it''s difficult to discern a 3-dimensional object here (it looks like it may be a screenshot).  In any case, the ''feeling'' (texture) of the image is lost on me.', '2006-04-12 21:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308562, 317399, 509, '<td valign="top">I think this could be a strong subject, but needs more attention given to the lighting - the highlights are distributed somewhat randomly, making the image appear a little busy (imho).  It looks to me like direct sunlight, but a more controlled lighting set up could probably fix this up nicely.</td>', 'I think this could be a strong subject, but needs more attention given to the lighting - the highlights are distributed somewhat randomly, making the image appear a little busy (imho).  It looks to me like direct sunlight, but a more controlled lighting set up could probably fix this up nicely.', '2006-04-12 21:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308566, 317274, 48228, '<td valign="top">Amazing...</td>', 'Amazing...', '2006-04-12 21:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308568, 317622, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this is the best choice for textures in its current presentation - the subject blends in too well with the background, giving an overall flat look to the photo imho.  I think this might work with a fair amount of dodging and burning to better emphasize the cat and the lighting.</td>', 'I''m not sure this is the best choice for textures in its current presentation - the subject blends in too well with the background, giving an overall flat look to the photo imho.  I think this might work with a fair amount of dodging and burning to better emphasize the cat and the lighting.', '2006-04-12 21:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308577, 317417, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the burnt corners here - it (and the other elements of the photo) really strengthen the relationship to the title.  It looks to me like the 4 lesser peppers are slightly darker than the one at the front - I think I''d either prefer this exaggerated a bit more or have them all consistent, but that''s just my opinion.  Nice shot overall.</td>', 'I like the burnt corners here - it (and the other elements of the photo) really strengthen the relationship to the title.  It looks to me like the 4 lesser peppers are slightly darker than the one at the front - I think I''d either prefer this exaggerated a bit more or have them all consistent, but that''s just my opinion.  Nice shot overall.', '2006-04-12 21:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308581, 315588, 48228, '<td valign="top">I like the texture and the colors...</td>', 'I like the texture and the colors...', '2006-04-12 21:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308586, 314733, 509, '<td valign="top">The textures really aren''t emphasized here.  I''d suggest trying this with the flower in a more ''studio'' type setting - the harsh lighting is contributing to the lost highlights in the flower.  Alternately, this might have worked better with a top-down shot of the flower to lessen the blending of the green tones (the flower as the subject vs. the grasses/weeds behind it).  Keep trying though.</td>', 'The textures really aren''t emphasized here.  I''d suggest trying this with the flower in a more ''studio'' type setting - the harsh lighting is contributing to the lost highlights in the flower.  Alternately, this might have worked better with a top-down shot of the flower to lessen the blending of the green tones (the flower as the subject vs. the grasses/weeds behind it).  Keep trying though.', '2006-04-12 21:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308593, 317312, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject.  The raindrops are a nice touch.  The right bottom corner looks soft compared to the rest of the shot - maybe a smaller aperture to bring it all into sharp focus?  I like the contrast in the largest drop especially - the dark green offsets the black shadow of the drop nicely.  Some dodging and burning to accentuate this throughout the rest of the leaf might make this more visually appealing as well.  Still, a nice photo.</td>', 'Nice composition and subject.  The raindrops are a nice touch.  The right bottom corner looks soft compared to the rest of the shot - maybe a smaller aperture to bring it all into sharp focus?  I like the contrast in the largest drop especially - the dark green offsets the black shadow of the drop nicely.  Some dodging and burning to accentuate this throughout the rest of the leaf might make this more visually appealing as well.  Still, a nice photo.', '2006-04-12 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308600, 315976, 48228, '<td valign="top">Good collection of textures here...</td>', 'Good collection of textures here...', '2006-04-12 21:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308622, 315373, 48228, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection...</td>', 'I like the reflection...', '2006-04-12 21:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308627, 317782, 48228, '<td valign="top">great colors.....</td>', 'great colors.....', '2006-04-12 22:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308859, 317207, 51125, '<td valign="top">Nice tones but needs sharper focus.</td>', 'Nice tones but needs sharper focus.', '2006-04-12 23:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308883, 316735, 51125, '<td valign="top">Outstanding sky but too dark overall.</td>', 'Outstanding sky but too dark overall.', '2006-04-12 23:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308957, 316307, 30982, '<td valign="top">This belongs in "Life" magazine.  Magnificent.</td>', 'This belongs in "Life" magazine.  Magnificent.', '2006-04-13 00:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308961, 314787, 56765, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast between the texture of the wall and the window.</td>', 'I really like the contrast between the texture of the wall and the window.', '2006-04-13 00:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308986, 317287, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great colours and clarity. Cool subject as well.</td>', 'Great colours and clarity. Cool subject as well.', '2006-04-13 00:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309010, 317827, 23430, '<td valign="top">I tried to do this one last texture challenge but couldn''t get the light right like you have. Nice shot.</td>', 'I tried to do this one last texture challenge but couldn''t get the light right like you have. Nice shot.', '2006-04-13 01:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309032, 316587, 54838, '<td valign="top">Not bad for a stock photo, but it looks as though someone borrowed a shot intended for an ad and decided to use it for this challenge.</td>', 'Not bad for a stock photo, but it looks as though someone borrowed a shot intended for an ad and decided to use it for this challenge.', '2006-04-13 01:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309092, 317661, 43434, '<td valign="top">Great textures .. I like this shot.</td>', 'Great textures .. I like this shot.', '2006-04-13 01:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309111, 315044, 43434, '<td valign="top">Seems to be really oversharpened.</td>', 'Seems to be really oversharpened.', '2006-04-13 01:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309309, 317757, 44611, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail here and an interesting subject.  I think this would benefit from a slightly less centralised composition, and perhaps if we could see just a little more of the nut under the inner skin.</td>', 'Excellent detail here and an interesting subject.  I think this would benefit from a slightly less centralised composition, and perhaps if we could see just a little more of the nut under the inner skin.', '2006-04-13 03:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309485, 314046, 25355, '<td valign="top">Is that what you think it is? I''ve always known them as tracks for blind people, and it widens out there to let them know they''re at the pedestrian crossing. ;-)</td>', 'Is that what you think it is? I''ve always known them as tracks for blind people, and it widens out there to let them know they''re at the pedestrian crossing. ;-)', '2006-04-13 08:00:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2309492, 315750, 42792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo in itself but maybe less for this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful photo in itself but maybe less for this challenge.', '2006-04-13 08:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309503, 317190, 42792, '<td valign="top">The way the face and expression has been captured really makes this photo.  A pity the post-processing seems overdone and uneven.</td>', 'The way the face and expression has been captured really makes this photo.  A pity the post-processing seems overdone and uneven.', '2006-04-13 08:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309637, 317618, 44611, '<td valign="top">Looks like that squirrel''s playing peek-a-boo with you!   Great candid shot - would have done well in that challenge too I think.</td>', 'Looks like that squirrel''s playing peek-a-boo with you!   Great candid shot - would have done well in that challenge too I think.', '2006-04-13 09:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309646, 317257, 44611, '<td valign="top">Trying to be helpful here, as I don''t this this shot will score well.  Firstly, the focus isn''t close enough or detailed enough on the rhino hide to truly meet the challenge subject of texture.  Secondly, the fact that the face is almost completely hidden by the bush in the foreground, means that there is no true point of focus to the image as it stands.  On the other hand, the light is lovely as it shines on the skin and it''s just a shame you couldn''t get in closer for the shot.  Perhaps a tighter crop featuring just the upper middle part of the image would have done better.</td>', 'Trying to be helpful here, as I don''t this this shot will score well.  Firstly, the focus isn''t close enough or detailed enough on the rhino hide to truly meet the challenge subject of texture.  Secondly, the fact that the face is almost completely hidden by the bush in the foreground, means that there is no true point of focus to the image as it stands.  On the other hand, the light is lovely as it shines on the skin and it''s just a shame you couldn''t get in closer for the shot.  Perhaps a tighter crop featuring just the upper middle part of the image would have done better.', '2006-04-13 09:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309648, 317704, 44611, '<td valign="top">Yummy - my favourite food to eat.</td>', 'Yummy - my favourite food to eat.', '2006-04-13 09:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309652, 317134, 44611, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sure what has happened here, but somehow this seems to have lost it''s texture, possibly replaced simply by noise.  A great shame because the contrast in red and blue is great and I imagine the textures of the wood are fascinating.</td>', 'I''m really not sure what has happened here, but somehow this seems to have lost it''s texture, possibly replaced simply by noise.  A great shame because the contrast in red and blue is great and I imagine the textures of the wood are fascinating.', '2006-04-13 10:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309663, 316307, 53147, '<td valign="top">I almost didnt get to this one as I just remembered that I needed to finish out voting this category. Glad I did because this one knocked my socks off. In fact - I am going to bump it up again. Great shot. My only 10.</td>', 'I almost didnt get to this one as I just remembered that I needed to finish out voting this category. Glad I did because this one knocked my socks off. In fact - I am going to bump it up again. Great shot. My only 10.', '2006-04-13 10:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309672, 316123, 56383, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrasts.  I love it.</td>', 'Beautiful contrasts.  I love it.', '2006-04-13 10:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309709, 314780, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Not very useful comment, I realize, but great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.  Not very useful comment, I realize, but great shot.', '2006-04-13 10:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309723, 316737, 35804, '<td valign="top">Really nice light and colors...the shallow focus gives those great textures a wonderful 3 dimensional quality...very nice.</td>', 'Really nice light and colors...the shallow focus gives those great textures a wonderful 3 dimensional quality...very nice.', '2006-04-13 10:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309724, 317797, 35804, '<td valign="top">Love the yellow of the dragon against the deep blue background...and fantastic textures needless to sasy.</td>', 'Love the yellow of the dragon against the deep blue background...and fantastic textures needless to sasy.', '2006-04-13 10:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309729, 317012, 35804, '<td valign="top">This image really kind of stopped me in my tracks...I really love the grand/epic quaity of this particular view...such light and drama..and I also love the fact that this really looks like a painting...beautiful work.</td>', 'This image really kind of stopped me in my tracks...I really love the grand/epic quaity of this particular view...such light and drama..and I also love the fact that this really looks like a painting...beautiful work.', '2006-04-13 10:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309732, 317403, 35804, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely image...the little fruit seems to be nestled comfortably in it''s cozy spot...very nice.</td>', 'Such a lovely image...the little fruit seems to be nestled comfortably in it''s cozy spot...very nice.', '2006-04-13 10:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309806, 314780, 41746, '<td valign="top">Magnificent!10.</td>', 'Magnificent!10.', '2006-04-13 11:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309827, 315855, 51125, '<td valign="top">Wonderful softness and strong post-processing creates etheral light.</td>', 'Wonderful softness and strong post-processing creates etheral light.', '2006-04-13 11:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309831, 315888, 51125, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective.  The toning is not really working for me here.  Too cool (literally).</td>', 'Very cool perspective.  The toning is not really working for me here.  Too cool (literally).', '2006-04-13 11:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309834, 317617, 51125, '<td valign="top">Best take on bark yet.</td>', 'Best take on bark yet.', '2006-04-13 11:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309852, 317313, 44611, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot - I particularly like the light and overall composition.  However, I don''t get an impression of texture - which is about touch - at all.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot - I particularly like the light and overall composition.  However, I don''t get an impression of texture - which is about touch - at all.', '2006-04-13 11:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309864, 316364, 11895, '<td valign="top">This entry would have scored higher with me if the editing was less obvious.  The darkness around the edges, and other effects, take to much of my attention away from what looks to be a fairly decent photgraph.  My impression is dominated by the post processing, and thoughts of what might have been.</td>', 'This entry would have scored higher with me if the editing was less obvious.  The darkness around the edges, and other effects, take to much of my attention away from what looks to be a fairly decent photgraph.  My impression is dominated by the post processing, and thoughts of what might have been.', '2006-04-13 11:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309865, 316394, 44611, '<td valign="top">I wish this had stayed with the waves at the bottom - the shadow and different lay of the fabric (blanket/s?) at the top right spoil the image for me sadly.  And yet that bottom left portion is wonderful - the rich red with perfect lighting and interesting abstract shapes.... .  Potentially a great image, but just missing out.</td>', 'I wish this had stayed with the waves at the bottom - the shadow and different lay of the fabric (blanket/s?) at the top right spoil the image for me sadly.  And yet that bottom left portion is wonderful - the rich red with perfect lighting and interesting abstract shapes.... .  Potentially a great image, but just missing out.', '2006-04-13 11:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309881, 316938, 11895, '<td valign="top">appears that very little of this image is in focus, perhaps a greater depth of field would have made it look better</td>', 'appears that very little of this image is in focus, perhaps a greater depth of field would have made it look better', '2006-04-13 11:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309883, 316354, 37961, '<td valign="top">Willard</td>', 'Willard', '2006-04-13 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309884, 314287, 37961, '<td valign="top">Love that splash of orange and yellow. Neat!</td>', 'Love that splash of orange and yellow. Neat!', '2006-04-13 11:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309925, 314780, 56752, '<td valign="top">This looks interesting, and the PP would be fine except it makes the face look a little strange, almost disconnected from the main part of the image.</td>', 'This looks interesting, and the PP would be fine except it makes the face look a little strange, almost disconnected from the main part of the image.', '2006-04-13 12:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309930, 317547, 56752, '<td valign="top">I think this would look great with some darkening of the midtones, to give it a weathered look</td>', 'I think this would look great with some darkening of the midtones, to give it a weathered look', '2006-04-13 12:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309932, 314733, 56752, '<td valign="top">The flower is blown out which makes it difficult to observe any texture in what should be the main part of the image</td>', 'The flower is blown out which makes it difficult to observe any texture in what should be the main part of the image', '2006-04-13 12:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309948, 317546, 37818, '<td valign="top">ewww</td>', 'ewww', '2006-04-13 12:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309952, 317349, 37818, '<td valign="top">I find her wrinkled skirt distracting....</td>', 'I find her wrinkled skirt distracting....', '2006-04-13 12:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309953, 317323, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, I just don''t think it shows off the texture of the seagull very well...</td>', 'I like the photo, I just don''t think it shows off the texture of the seagull very well...', '2006-04-13 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309957, 317772, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is too out of focus and noisy... otherwise it would have been a nice photo...</td>', 'This is too out of focus and noisy... otherwise it would have been a nice photo...', '2006-04-13 12:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309960, 317761, 55738, '<td valign="top">I really like this guy... he looks sweet in this photo...</td>', 'I really like this guy... he looks sweet in this photo...', '2006-04-13 12:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309962, 317760, 55738, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too soft focus at his face and that detracts from the photo...</td>', 'It''s a little too soft focus at his face and that detracts from the photo...', '2006-04-13 12:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309965, 317794, 55738, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get texture out of this...</td>', 'I don''t quite get texture out of this...', '2006-04-13 12:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309987, 314733, 55738, '<td valign="top">A little too out of focus...</td>', 'A little too out of focus...', '2006-04-13 12:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309996, 316596, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo, but I''m not sure if it meets the challenge very well...</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo, but I''m not sure if it meets the challenge very well...', '2006-04-13 12:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309998, 317711, 55738, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, but it''s over processed...</td>', 'I like the colors, but it''s over processed...', '2006-04-13 12:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310111, 317800, 30605, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time trying to find an area which is in good focus. Also, the lighting can be perfected; there''s too much glare for what I wold expect in this kind of shot. I don''t know if the leaf was wet, but a diffuse or inderect light source would have yielded better results.</td>', 'I have a hard time trying to find an area which is in good focus. Also, the lighting can be perfected; there''s too much glare for what I wold expect in this kind of shot. I don''t know if the leaf was wet, but a diffuse or inderect light source would have yielded better results.', '2006-04-13 13:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310112, 317312, 37103, '<td valign="top">Lovely leaf and water droplets.  I think I might prefer this centered.</td>', 'Lovely leaf and water droplets.  I think I might prefer this centered.', '2006-04-13 13:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310116, 317767, 37103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures and subtle colors on the wood.  The few blades of grass are a little distracting, but overall great entry.</td>', 'Beautiful textures and subtle colors on the wood.  The few blades of grass are a little distracting, but overall great entry.', '2006-04-13 13:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310119, 317457, 30605, '<td valign="top">The photo is not a bad one, but not a top ten either. However, you choose to submit a rather small photo in the first ever challenge that allow 720x720 photographs. Even if it were an exceptional photograh, it would never score high. You got to use the maximum allowed resolution (at least in height or width) to get a chance against the rest.</td>', 'The photo is not a bad one, but not a top ten either. However, you choose to submit a rather small photo in the first ever challenge that allow 720x720 photographs. Even if it were an exceptional photograh, it would never score high. You got to use the maximum allowed resolution (at least in height or width) to get a chance against the rest.', '2006-04-13 13:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310123, 317191, 37103, '<td valign="top">Very nice angle and great use of shadow.  I don''t feel like the textures are as strong as they could be.  Remind me of Yellowstone Ntl Park.  I love the mist in the upper right corner.</td>', 'Very nice angle and great use of shadow.  I don''t feel like the textures are as strong as they could be.  Remind me of Yellowstone Ntl Park.  I love the mist in the upper right corner.', '2006-04-13 13:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310127, 317773, 37103, '<td valign="top">Great shot and angle.  I wish the paw were a little more in focus as that is the center of attention.  But you showed just the right amount of his face and the textures of the blanket (and color) also really complements the photo a lot.  Nice entry.</td>', 'Great shot and angle.  I wish the paw were a little more in focus as that is the center of attention.  But you showed just the right amount of his face and the textures of the blanket (and color) also really complements the photo a lot.  Nice entry.', '2006-04-13 13:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310195, 316307, 55554, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very nice.....</td>', 'Wow. Very nice.....', '2006-04-13 14:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310218, 317613, 44534, '<td valign="top">I find the carrot tremendously distracting!!!!</td>', 'I find the carrot tremendously distracting!!!!', '2006-04-13 14:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310314, 317613, 16241, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2006-04-13 15:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310339, 315109, 50674, '<td valign="top">Majestic, thrilling, beautiful tones, wonderful idea, a ribbon I hope.</td>', 'Majestic, thrilling, beautiful tones, wonderful idea, a ribbon I hope.', '2006-04-13 15:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310340, 316521, 50674, '<td valign="top">Very many good shots in this challenge, yours in one of the best. An elephant is a huge animal, everything about an elefant is huge and you managed to portray that. And then there is that sad tired (old?) eye and one almost cries elephant tears for him/her :-) Very well done, hope there is a ribbon waiting for you.</td>', 'Very many good shots in this challenge, yours in one of the best. An elephant is a huge animal, everything about an elefant is huge and you managed to portray that. And then there is that sad tired (old?) eye and one almost cries elephant tears for him/her :-) Very well done, hope there is a ribbon waiting for you.', '2006-04-13 15:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310358, 317497, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2006-04-13 15:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310385, 314923, 57194, '<td valign="top">Just one word: amazing!</td>', 'Just one word: amazing!', '2006-04-13 15:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310506, 317040, 30392, '<td valign="top">Real sharp, plenty of texture but not too interesting. Maybe the composition is too static?</td>', 'Real sharp, plenty of texture but not too interesting. Maybe the composition is too static?', '2006-04-13 17:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310508, 317800, 30392, '<td valign="top">huh, quality is off, lots of pixelly artifacts</td>', 'huh, quality is off, lots of pixelly artifacts', '2006-04-13 17:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310510, 317627, 30392, '<td valign="top">that''s really cool, nice comp, plenty of texture! Excellent, refreshing macro!</td>', 'that''s really cool, nice comp, plenty of texture! Excellent, refreshing macro!', '2006-04-13 17:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2310515, 317818, 30392, '<td valign="top">This is making my eyes go funny. I sort of like it though</td>', 'This is making my eyes go funny. I sort of like it though', '2006-04-13 17:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
