(2311366, 314015, 30605, '<td valign="top">You can go simpler than that. It''s really working here. The shallow dof and the diagonal formed by the line on the right side creates a nice big triangle and you got a big rectangle on the opposite side. Makes it''s balanced but dynamic. <br/>And oh, the texture is well defined in the focus area.</td>', 'You can go simpler than that. It''s really working here. The shallow dof and the diagonal formed by the line on the right side creates a nice big triangle and you got a big rectangle on the opposite side. Makes it''s balanced but dynamic. And oh, the texture is well defined in the focus area.', '2006-04-14 00:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2311367, 317662, 30605, '<td valign="top">Pretty solid picture. That''s what making a photograph instead of taking a photograph is all about.<br/>One minus note, the left side of her face is almost overexposed; it draw too much attention.</td>', 'Pretty solid picture. That''s what making a photograph instead of taking a photograph is all about.One minus note, the left side of her face is almost overexposed; it draw too much attention.', '2006-04-14 00:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
