(2311424, 317148, 34938, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame this was dq''d, but you cannot put text to your images. I am sure you know that by now. As far as the photo is concernes, what a stunning model, beautifully photographed with a real 1950''s feel. In another challenge this would have done really well</td>', 'It''s a shame this was dq''d, but you cannot put text to your images. I am sure you know that by now. As far as the photo is concernes, what a stunning model, beautifully photographed with a real 1950''s feel. In another challenge this would have done really well', '2006-04-14 01:23:04.000000', NULL, 0),
