(2311527, 316307, 11923, '<td valign="top">What I like best about this photo is if you were to crop it anywhere, be it just the hands, the bottom half of her face, just her eyes.. it is still powerful and spellbinding in its rich detail.  Very few images I''ve seen can so easily become multiple  mini-masterpieces when broken up that way.  Amazing detail, amazing woman, amazing talent.</td>', 'What I like best about this photo is if you were to crop it anywhere, be it just the hands, the bottom half of her face, just her eyes.. it is still powerful and spellbinding in its rich detail.  Very few images I''ve seen can so easily become multiple  mini-masterpieces when broken up that way.  Amazing detail, amazing woman, amazing talent.', '2006-04-14 02:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2311550, 317321, 28710, '<td valign="top">Dude. Totally awesome. I did not know there was such a picture in the challenge, but I took some shots posted in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=375485" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> thread probably within a few days of your pic. I like yours a bit better for the BG and color treatment though.<br/> <br/>Nice.<br/> <br/>I will probably post more details and setup shots later on to maintain that a bit when I get time for those who are interested.</td>', 'Dude. Totally awesome. I did not know there was such a picture in the challenge, but I took some shots posted in this thread probably within a few days of your pic. I like yours a bit better for the BG and color treatment though. Nice. I will probably post more details and setup shots later on to maintain that a bit when I get time for those who are interested.', '2006-04-14 02:25:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2311559, 316307, 28710, '<td valign="top">This was my pick for the blue. Nice to see a pic get over 8 again. And a quite healthy 8+.<br/> <br/>This picture stopped me in my tracks and I ended up just staring at it for about 5 minutes. Seeing it in the larger format just added a little bit. <br/> <br/>Interestingly, I just met someone from Iloilo two days ago. First time I have met someone from that part of the Philippines.</td>', 'This was my pick for the blue. Nice to see a pic get over 8 again. And a quite healthy 8+. This picture stopped me in my tracks and I ended up just staring at it for about 5 minutes. Seeing it in the larger format just added a little bit.  Interestingly, I just met someone from Iloilo two days ago. First time I have met someone from that part of the Philippines.', '2006-04-14 02:28:51.000000', NULL, 0),
