(2311688, 315876, 52908, '<td valign="top">At the time of this shoot, I was told to get ready to go to Iraq for a year. That out of focus horizon at the end of all that sand... Is hope, my friends. Also, this is a color image. There''s just nothing color in it to make it obvious. Thanks for the comments!! I love shooting on this site!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-14 02:43:50.</i></td>', 'At the time of this shoot, I was told to get ready to go to Iraq for a year. That out of focus horizon at the end of all that sand... Is hope, my friends. Also, this is a color image. There''s just nothing color in it to make it obvious. Thanks for the comments!! I love shooting on this site!', '2006-04-14 03:42:39.000000', '2006-04-14 03:43:50.000000', 0),
