(2311747, 317303, 48228, '<td valign="top">I really like this and so sorry I missed it during voting.....<br/> <br/>I am adding this to my favorites as well, as you are quite a guy, and thank you so much for the comment you left me, reguarding my image called "Firestone", which is also in this "Textures" challenge.....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-14 03:49:09.</i></td>', 'I really like this and so sorry I missed it during voting..... I am adding this to my favorites as well, as you are quite a guy, and thank you so much for the comment you left me, reguarding my image called "Firestone", which is also in this "Textures" challenge.....', '2006-04-14 04:46:58.000000', '2006-04-14 04:49:09.000000', 0),
(2311751, 317773, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is such a good Textures entry and such a nice photo in general. The blanket and the cat both have such cool textures and we don''t normally think about the contrast, but it''s there. You got the comment (in a forum thread, I think) that you can almost feel the cat purring --- I liked that description of this image. The only small thing that I can say might be an improvement is if the light on the cat''s arm wasn''t so strong. It kind of pulls my eye away from the cool shadows in the rough-looking blanket and the soft cat fur. Really nice job!!</td>', 'This is such a good Textures entry and such a nice photo in general. The blanket and the cat both have such cool textures and we don''t normally think about the contrast, but it''s there. You got the comment (in a forum thread, I think) that you can almost feel the cat purring --- I liked that description of this image. The only small thing that I can say might be an improvement is if the light on the cat''s arm wasn''t so strong. It kind of pulls my eye away from the cool shadows in the rough-looking blanket and the soft cat fur. Really nice job!!', '2006-04-14 04:53:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2311758, 314796, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is soooo beautiful, Kelly! I love the strength and grit you''ve brought out. You have the most amazing skill - my deepest thanks to you for the inspiration you give with your images. Don''t get too busy with the new office that you can''t keep doing things like this - you''re the best!</td>', 'This is soooo beautiful, Kelly! I love the strength and grit you''ve brought out. You have the most amazing skill - my deepest thanks to you for the inspiration you give with your images. Don''t get too busy with the new office that you can''t keep doing things like this - you''re the best!', '2006-04-14 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
