(2311949, 317796, 25355, '<td valign="top">I was one of the 10s - though I didn''t know whose it was, of course. He has a creepy eye, but the scale detail is beautiful. well done.</td>', 'I was one of the 10s - though I didn''t know whose it was, of course. He has a creepy eye, but the scale detail is beautiful. well done.', '2006-04-14 09:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
