(2312150, 316307, 38127, '<td valign="top">Manny, you have no idea how much of an impact this portrait has had on me... truly its magical in every sense of the word magical!!  She is wonderful and what you have captured within her .. amazing.. thank you so much for taking the time to introduce us to such a wonderful, powerful soul.. i''d love to see the rest of the images you took.. <br/> <br/>Wow!!!</td>', 'Manny, you have no idea how much of an impact this portrait has had on me... truly its magical in every sense of the word magical!!  She is wonderful and what you have captured within her .. amazing.. thank you so much for taking the time to introduce us to such a wonderful, powerful soul.. i''d love to see the rest of the images you took..  Wow!!!', '2006-04-14 10:54:48.000000', NULL, 0),
