(2410626, 317539, 24486, '<td valign="top">I really like your perspective &amp; the use of desat is wonderful. I''m not really too sure about putting this in a Textures challenge. This actually looks too clean for me. By that I mean there is no rough textures like rust although I sure there is but by desating the tracks I think you have actually hidden your rough textures. In my personal opinion I think most Dpcers in this challenge were looking for not so smoother content of your subject. <br/> <br/>Regardless of my thoughts about putting this in a textures challenge, this is still a really great photograph &amp; Im  adding it to my favourites.</td>', 'I really like your perspective & the use of desat is wonderful. I''m not really too sure about putting this in a Textures challenge. This actually looks too clean for me. By that I mean there is no rough textures like rust although I sure there is but by desating the tracks I think you have actually hidden your rough textures. In my personal opinion I think most Dpcers in this challenge were looking for not so smoother content of your subject.  Regardless of my thoughts about putting this in a textures challenge, this is still a really great photograph & Im  adding it to my favourites.', '2006-05-12 20:26:18.000000', NULL, 0),
