(2476178, 315888, 42100, '<td valign="top">I was looking for something in your portfolio that I could comment on for the ''Need Comments'' thread that I could offer some acutal critique.  But then I came to this and needed to comment, even though I couldn''t offer anything constructive.  I really like how you the textures of the petal creates some amazing leading lines that draw you right into this photo.  I also like your choice of DOF, it really makes all the water droplets pop along that back edge of the petal.  What I don''t understand is how this didn''t score above a six, maybe not enough texture for some?!?</td>', 'I was looking for something in your portfolio that I could comment on for the ''Need Comments'' thread that I could offer some acutal critique.  But then I came to this and needed to comment, even though I couldn''t offer anything constructive.  I really like how you the textures of the petal creates some amazing leading lines that draw you right into this photo.  I also like your choice of DOF, it really makes all the water droplets pop along that back edge of the petal.  What I don''t understand is how this didn''t score above a six, maybe not enough texture for some?!?', '2006-06-01 14:43:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2479161, 317786, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think the concept and colors of this shot are excellent. I do think that using much deeper DOF would have strengthened the message of "texture" for this challenge, and it would have added significant interest in the shot. I think the lighting emphasizes texture well, and the position of the shell within the frame is great. There is a good deal of grain in the shot which I think degrades it just a little.</td>', 'I think the concept and colors of this shot are excellent. I do think that using much deeper DOF would have strengthened the message of "texture" for this challenge, and it would have added significant interest in the shot. I think the lighting emphasizes texture well, and the position of the shell within the frame is great. There is a good deal of grain in the shot which I think degrades it just a little.', '2006-06-02 14:31:50.000000', NULL, 0),
