(2700561, 316307, 63484, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC!~</td>', 'FANTASTIC!~', '2006-08-06 23:37:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2742825, 317611, 48228, '<td valign="top">I really love the striking color contrast of this simple subject matter image of an orange. <br/>A really strong image that stands alone.</td>', 'I really love the striking color contrast of this simple subject matter image of an orange. A really strong image that stands alone.', '2006-08-20 01:06:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2743226, 317611, 57060, '<td valign="top">Now I''ll speak of something I know almost nothing about... but here goes. In his book "Mastering Color Digital Photography" by Michael Freeman ( agreat book btw) he speaks about various color combos including orange and blue. He says "because orange is twice as luminous as blue the two colors work best in a ratio of 2 blue to 1 orange" (I''m paraphrasing here.) I wonder, if using this as a guide if your orange were a bit smaller, to allow the area ratio described above, the picture may be more effective. It appears that you are closer to 1 to 1.<br/> <br/>Anyway, just a thought, nice job.<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Now I''ll speak of something I know almost nothing about... but here goes. In his book "Mastering Color Digital Photography" by Michael Freeman ( agreat book btw) he speaks about various color combos including orange and blue. He says "because orange is twice as luminous as blue the two colors work best in a ratio of 2 blue to 1 orange" (I''m paraphrasing here.) I wonder, if using this as a guide if your orange were a bit smaller, to allow the area ratio described above, the picture may be more effective. It appears that you are closer to 1 to 1. Anyway, just a thought, nice job. Jack', '2006-08-20 09:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2763768, 316307, 64670, '<td valign="top">I ADORE this photo.<br/> <br/>I really liked reading the story behind it too - thank you for sharing the journey to this shot!<br/></td>', 'I ADORE this photo. I really liked reading the story behind it too - thank you for sharing the journey to this shot!', '2006-08-27 02:38:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2786312, 317287, 24022, '<td valign="top">Awesome pic</td>', 'Awesome pic', '2006-09-02 00:48:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2815080, 317593, 30049, '<td valign="top">He-He.  This IS a cool shot, and perfect for the challenge you entered it in.  I enjoyed reading the story behind the effort it took to get it.  I wish more people put some background info into their submitted images (I only do it once in awhile myself).<br/> <br/>As for the image I think the harsh lighting may have helped some in this case as it tends to really enhance contrast via shadows.  Those shadows are what brings out the details in this turtle''s skin.  The only item that jumps out to me as a distraction is the eye...it could be the color, but it looks a little blurry to me.  It should be sharp looking at other areas of the image as the eye falls into the DOF range - maybe he/she moved the eye during exposure?<br/> <br/>Anyway...overall, nicely done, and <u>underrated</u>!  ;^)</td>', 'He-He.  This IS a cool shot, and perfect for the challenge you entered it in.  I enjoyed reading the story behind the effort it took to get it.  I wish more people put some background info into their submitted images (I only do it once in awhile myself). As for the image I think the harsh lighting may have helped some in this case as it tends to really enhance contrast via shadows.  Those shadows are what brings out the details in this turtle''s skin.  The only item that jumps out to me as a distraction is the eye...it could be the color, but it looks a little blurry to me.  It should be sharp looking at other areas of the image as the eye falls into the DOF range - maybe he/she moved the eye during exposure? Anyway...overall, nicely done, and underrated!  ;^)', '2006-09-08 12:45:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2820775, 315575, 60373, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot. The colors,lighting and texture are excellent.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot. The colors,lighting and texture are excellent.', '2006-09-10 17:46:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2837057, 316307, 54539, '<td valign="top">amazing photo!!</td>', 'amazing photo!!', '2006-09-15 01:55:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2845533, 316307, 65798, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-09-18 17:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2851459, 317778, 53316, '<td valign="top">What you did with the lighting really works.  I think that the one thing that bothers me a bit is looking at the square of squares on the right, I feel like the right edge should be parallel to the edge of the shot.  Other than that I like the composition - maybe would have liked to see a looser crop so that the circular areas could look more completed, but then you''d loose the focus on the texture (so I think you did make the right choice for this challenge!).</td>', 'What you did with the lighting really works.  I think that the one thing that bothers me a bit is looking at the square of squares on the right, I feel like the right edge should be parallel to the edge of the shot.  Other than that I like the composition - maybe would have liked to see a looser crop so that the circular areas could look more completed, but then you''d loose the focus on the texture (so I think you did make the right choice for this challenge!).', '2006-09-20 15:38:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2903624, 317722, 24212, '<td valign="top">The textures are, indeed, lovely and pronounced, although I feel that there needs to be something added to make the gas tap stand out from the wall, particularly at the bottom.The colours are stunning.</td>', 'The textures are, indeed, lovely and pronounced, although I feel that there needs to be something added to make the gas tap stand out from the wall, particularly at the bottom.The colours are stunning.', '2006-10-06 16:24:26.000000', NULL, 0),
