(3386131, 317558, 30861, '<td valign="top">I just ran across this today. I''m sorry I never commented on it; it''s quite beautiful. I bet you''d have bagged a 6.5+ if you''d cropped it square and shown a 640x640 of the bristles with much less background. Was it really shot with the 15mm?<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'I just ran across this today. I''m sorry I never commented on it; it''s quite beautiful. I bet you''d have bagged a 6.5+ if you''d cropped it square and shown a 640x640 of the bristles with much less background. Was it really shot with the 15mm? R.', '2007-02-20 16:53:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3388638, 316307, 73068, '<td valign="top">Shivers! The depth of this picture goes beyond what you see. It really is a book in a picture, every pixel is a chapter! Congratulations on your encounter and thank you for bringing it to us.. As they say in your language, Salamat!</td>', 'Shivers! The depth of this picture goes beyond what you see. It really is a book in a picture, every pixel is a chapter! Congratulations on your encounter and thank you for bringing it to us.. As they say in your language, Salamat!', '2007-02-21 08:58:18.000000', NULL, 0),
