(3759523, 315088, 31637, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot and probably perfect. I am surprised of it''s score despite the good placing, it should have placed higher. I guess people are biased and forget this is a photography contest.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot and probably perfect. I am surprised of it''s score despite the good placing, it should have placed higher. I guess people are biased and forget this is a photography contest.', '2007-06-09 04:20:19.000000', NULL, 0),
