(4025289, 316307, 26194, '<td valign="top">Who ever voted below a 5 on this image was just trying to better their own results because if you can''t see the beauty and exactness capturing light shadows tones etc in this picture then you must be blind. This image is Photography. psart. Ok I''m done lol</td>', 'Who ever voted below a 5 on this image was just trying to better their own results because if you can''t see the beauty and exactness capturing light shadows tones etc in this picture then you must be blind. This image is Photography. psart. Ok I''m done lol', '2007-08-24 01:20:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4133872, 316307, 84886, '<td valign="top">wow powerful message<br/>you can see that she has gone through alot</td>', 'wow powerful messageyou can see that she has gone through alot', '2007-10-02 16:25:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4139202, 317797, 43463, '<td valign="top">Your tones &amp; contrasts are wonderful for it really calls attention the scales and textures of this lizard. Love the sharpness of details in the scales especially in the ''spikes''. The square format was a good choice for it keeps the eye squarely focused on the main subject - the head of this dragon and all the lovely details in the skin. My only critique/observation is that the border is slightly detracting from the stunning capture. The red border around the photo does not match any color tone from the photo itself - usually a clean white and/or black border is more effective in framing the photo without calling attention to itself. Nonetheless wonderful job!</td>', 'Your tones & contrasts are wonderful for it really calls attention the scales and textures of this lizard. Love the sharpness of details in the scales especially in the ''spikes''. The square format was a good choice for it keeps the eye squarely focused on the main subject - the head of this dragon and all the lovely details in the skin. My only critique/observation is that the border is slightly detracting from the stunning capture. The red border around the photo does not match any color tone from the photo itself - usually a clean white and/or black border is more effective in framing the photo without calling attention to itself. Nonetheless wonderful job!', '2007-10-03 22:09:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4140961, 317797, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love dragons and this is an excellent photo! What great colors and textures!</td>', 'I love dragons and this is an excellent photo! What great colors and textures!', '2007-10-04 13:03:01.000000', NULL, 0),
